"level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Kalimat manakah yang SALAH? (Perhatikan maf'ul bih mutsanna.)","ar":null,"explanation":"Maf'ul bih mutsanna manshub dengan ya': قَلَمَيْنِ. Bentuk قَلَمَانِ (alif) adalah bentuk rafa'.","time":25,"options":["اِشْتَرَيْتُ قَلَمَانِ","اِشْتَرَيْتُ قَلَمَيْنِ","اِشْتَرَيْتُ قَلَمًا","اِشْتَرَيْتُ أَقْلَامًا"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"1de84e706f1b5ae99222453dd2df7698","cat":"maful-bih","type":"sentence_analysis","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Manakah maf'ul bih pada kalimat berikut?","ar":"يُحِبُّ اللّٰهُ الصَّابِرِينَ","explanation":"اللّٰهُ fa'il; الصَّابِرِينَ maf'ul bih manshub dengan ya'.","time":25,"options":["الصَّابِرِينَ","اللّٰهُ","يُحِبُّ","Tidak ada maf'ul bih"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"8f8080256f4ce06367df520587f5d29d","cat":"maful-bih","type":"irab_challenge","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"أَكْرَمَنِي [[الْأُسْتَاذُ]]","explanation":"أَكْرَمَ + نُونُ الْوِقَايَةِ + ي (maf'ul bih, dhamir). الْأُسْتَاذُ adalah fa'il yang diakhirkan, marfu' dengan dhammah.","time":30,"options":["Fa'il marfu' dengan dhammah (maf'ul bih-nya dhamir ي)","Maf'ul bih manshub","Mubtada' marfu'","Badal marfu'"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"7d42c5978ebd5471092abeae8ebd03da","cat":"naat","type":"irab_challenge","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"جَاءَ رَجُلٌ [[كَرِيمٌ]]","explanation":"كَرِيمٌ sifat bagi رَجُلٌ (fa'il, marfu'), maka na'at marfu' mengikuti man'ut-nya.","time":20,"options":["Na'at marfu' dengan dhammah","Khabar marfu' dengan dhammah","Fa'il marfu' dengan dhammah","Hal manshub"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"d76a1e0d4aaee0be56d811508f682b6d","cat":"naat","type":"irab_challenge","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"رَأَيْتُ الطِّفْلَ [[الصَّغِيرَ]]","explanation":"الصَّغِيرَ na'at bagi الطِّفْلَ (maf'ul bih), mengikuti nashab dan ma'rifah.","time":25,"options":["Na'at manshub dengan fathah","Maf'ul bih kedua manshub","Hal manshub","Tamyiz manshub"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"524576fd4370d5de3e843f643f8efb80","cat":"naat","type":"irab_challenge","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"فِي الْمَدِينَةِ مَسَاجِدُ [[كَثِيرَةٌ]]","explanation":"كَثِيرَةٌ na'at bagi مَسَاجِدُ (mubtada' muakhkhar, marfu'). Jamak taksir tidak berakal diberi na'at muannats mufrad.","time":25,"options":["Na'at marfu' dengan dhammah","Khabar marfu' dengan dhammah","Na'at majrur","Mubtada' marfu'"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"60b8e7b93fe65633950c836c43830411","cat":"naat","type":"nahwu_battle","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Pilih na'at yang tepat untuk melengkapi kalimat.","ar":"هَذِهِ مَدْرَسَةٌ ـــــ","explanation":"Man'ut مَدْرَسَةٌ: marfu', nakirah, muannats → كَبِيرَةٌ.","time":20,"options":["كَبِيرَةٌ","كَبِيرٌ","كَبِيرَةً","الْكَبِيرَةُ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"41f56b2929d9a6555615955cbc409525","cat":"naat","type":"nahwu_battle","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Pilih na'at yang tepat untuk melengkapi kalimat.","ar":"سَلَّمْتُ عَلَى الْمُعَلِّمِ ـــــ","explanation":"Man'ut الْمُعَلِّمِ majrur dan ma'rifah → na'at الْجَدِيدِ.","time":25,"options":["الْجَدِيدِ","الْجَدِيدَ","الْجَدِيدُ","جَدِيدٍ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"bdcd4b454f377ad85a8f07663ef4a3c8","cat":"naat","type":"nahwu_battle","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Pilih na'at yang tepat untuk melengkapi kalimat.","ar":"جَاءَ الطُّلَّابُ ـــــ","explanation":"Man'ut الطُّلَّابُ (marfu', ma'rifah, jamak berakal) → الْمُجْتَهِدُونَ.","time":30,"options":["الْمُجْتَهِدُونَ","الْمُجْتَهِدِينَ","مُجْتَهِدُونَ","الْمُجْتَهِدُ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"3f9df1ba3312fc167f16af576de48334","cat":"naat","type":"grammar_detective","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Kalimat manakah yang SALAH? (Perhatikan ma'rifah-nakirah na'at.)","ar":null,"explanation":"Na'at harus sesuai man'ut-nya dalam ma'rifah/nakirah dan diletakkan langsung setelahnya. Susunan جَمِيلٌ الْكَبِيرُ salah.","time":25,"options":["هَذَا الْبَيْتُ جَمِيلٌ الْكَبِيرُ","هَذَا بَيْتٌ كَبِيرٌ","هَذَا الْبَيْتُ الْكَبِيرُ جَمِيلٌ","رَأَيْتُ بَيْتًا كَبِيرًا"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"5b821b70097f4bed668c3184965295c0","cat":"naat","type":"sentence_analysis","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Na'at pada kalimat berikut berbentuk …","ar":"قَرَأْتُ كِتَابًا فَائِدَتُهُ كَبِيرَةٌ","explanation":"Na'at bagi كِتَابًا adalah jumlah فَائِدَتُهُ كَبِيرَةٌ (mubtada' + khabar), yaitu jumlah ismiyyah fi mahalli nashb.","time":30,"options":["Jumlah ismiyyah","Mufrad","Syibhu jumlah","Jumlah fi'liyyah"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"f3cf2850f8106b45ef6df4a50d141ea5","cat":"naat","type":"irab_challenge","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"هَذَا رَجُلٌ [[مِنْ مِصْرَ]]","explanation":"Jar-majrur setelah isim nakirah (رَجُلٌ) berkedudukan na'at; mengikuti رَجُلٌ yang marfu' (khabar).","time":30,"options":["Syibhu jumlah sebagai na'at fi mahalli raf'","Khabar kedua","Hal manshub","Maf'ul bih"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"14418d045a26cccb598e48260c2f837d","cat":"idhafah","type":"irab_challenge","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"هَذِهِ حَقِيبَةُ [[الطَّالِبَةِ]]","explanation":"الطَّالِبَةِ mudhaf ilaih bagi حَقِيبَةُ, majrur dengan kasrah.","time":20,"options":["Mudhaf ilaih majrur dengan kasrah","Na'at majrur","Isim majrur dengan huruf jar","Maf'ul bih manshub"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"5523994db0b47528da1e01dc295ba115","cat":"idhafah","type":"irab_challenge","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"دَخَلْتُ مَسْجِدَ [[الْجَامِعَةِ]]","explanation":"الْجَامِعَةِ mudhaf ilaih; مَسْجِدَ maf'ul bih (manshub) dan sekaligus mudhaf.","time":25,"options":["Mudhaf ilaih majrur dengan kasrah","Maf'ul bih manshub","Na'at majrur","Isim majrur oleh huruf jar"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"69f4da893ed05e9ca426eae46a0f7e1f","cat":"idhafah","type":"irab_challenge","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"هَذَا بَيْتُ [[إِبْرَاهِيمَ]]","explanation":"إِبْرَاهِيمَ mudhaf ilaih. Nama 'ajam mamnu' min ash-sharf, di-jarr-kan dengan fathah.","time":25,"options":["Mudhaf ilaih majrur dengan fathah karena mamnu' min ash-sharf","Mudhaf ilaih majrur dengan kasrah","Maf'ul bih manshub","Badal"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"1d22a774efbaf9355d8de771ff172a82","cat":"idhafah","type":"irab_challenge","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"جَاءَ [[صَاحِبُ]] الْبَيْتِ","explanation":"صَاحِبُ fa'il dari جَاءَ dan sekaligus mudhaf (tanpa tanwin). الْبَيْتِ mudhaf ilaih.","time":30,"options":["Fa'il marfu' dengan dhammah dan mudhaf","Mubtada' marfu'","Mudhaf ilaih majrur","Na'at marfu'"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"bfcb4a8809b782782ccc26680b0b9756","cat":"idhafah","type":"nahwu_battle","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Pilih bentuk yang benar untuk melengkapi kalimat.","ar":"هَذَا ـــــ الْمَسْجِدِ","explanation":"Mudhaf tidak menerima ال dan tanwin: إِمَامُ الْمَسْجِدِ (khabar marfu').","time":20,"options":["إِمَامُ","الْإِمَامُ","إِمَامٌ","إِمَامًا"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"e28314951414e22e5dbad1271307fa1c","cat":"idhafah","type":"nahwu_battle","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Pilih mudhaf ilaih yang tepat untuk melengkapi kalimat.","ar":"قَرَأْتُ كِتَابَ ـــــ","explanation":"Mudhaf ilaih selalu majrur: كِتَابَ التَّفْسِيرِ.","time":25,"options":["التَّفْسِيرِ","التَّفْسِيرَ","التَّفْسِيرُ","تَفْسِيرٌ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"bd2f937a63c55683012f0e7947279ff2","cat":"idhafah","type":"nahwu_battle","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Pilih bentuk yang benar untuk melengkapi kalimat.","ar":"حَضَرَ ـــــ الْمَدْرَسَةِ","explanation":"Fa'il jamak mudzakkar salim yang menjadi mudhaf: nun dibuang, marfu' dengan wawu: حَضَرَ مُعَلِّمُو الْمَدْرَسَةِ.","time":30,"options":["مُعَلِّمُو","مُعَلِّمُونَ","مُعَلِّمِي","الْمُعَلِّمُونَ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"801090d41f13689d73f5abe0acae32ab","cat":"idhafah","type":"grammar_detective","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Kalimat manakah yang SALAH? (Perhatikan ال pada mudhaf.)","ar":null,"explanation":"Mudhaf tidak boleh diberi ال. Yang benar: غُرْفَةُ أَحْمَدَ.","time":20,"options":["هَذِهِ الْغُرْفَةُ أَحْمَدَ","هَذِهِ غُرْفَةُ أَحْمَدَ","هَذِهِ غُرْفَةٌ وَاسِعَةٌ","هَذِهِ الْغُرْفَةُ وَاسِعَةٌ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"c8aa5d60deec3e56854b01432474411a","cat":"idhafah","type":"grammar_detective","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Kalimat manakah yang SALAH? (Perhatikan nun mutsanna pada mudhaf.)","ar":null,"explanation":"Nun mutsanna dibuang ketika menjadi mudhaf: كِتَابَا الطَّالِبِ. Maka كِتَابَانِ الطَّالِبِ salah.","time":30,"options":["هَذَانِ كِتَابَانِ الطَّالِبِ","هَذَانِ كِتَابَا الطَّالِبِ","هَذَانِ كِتَابَانِ جَدِيدَانِ","رَأَيْتُ كِتَابَيِ الطَّالِبِ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"f4561a611b9ee336cc18b0d18e51ab54","cat":"idhafah","type":"sentence_analysis","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Manakah mudhaf pada susunan berikut?","ar":"بَابُ الْفَصْلِ مَفْتُوحٌ","explanation":"بَابُ adalah mudhaf (dan mubtada'), الْفَصْلِ mudhaf ilaih, مَفْتُوحٌ khabar.","time":25,"options":["بَابُ","الْفَصْلِ","مَفْتُوحٌ","Tidak ada mudhaf"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"c998ff46743f25f1e1c4ab2d4aeb0a14","cat":"idhafah","type":"sentence_analysis","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Berapa susunan idhafah dalam kalimat berikut?","ar":"مِفْتَاحُ بَابِ الْبَيْتِ","explanation":"مِفْتَاحُ ← بَابِ (idhafah pertama), بَابِ ← الْبَيْتِ (idhafah kedua). بَابِ menjadi mudhaf ilaih sekaligus mudhaf.","time":30,"options":["Dua (berantai)","Satu","Tiga","Tidak ada"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"1904633dc5c597cc9a1c50a4f587d544","cat":"mubtada-khabar","type":"irab_challenge","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"[[مَنْ]] فِي الْبَيْتِ؟","explanation":"مَنْ isim istifham (mabni 'ala as-sukun) yang berkedudukan mubtada'; فِي الْبَيْتِ khabarnya.","time":30,"options":["Isim istifham mabni, mubtada' fi mahalli raf'","Huruf jar","Khabar muqaddam","Fa'il"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"c218d679de54a53cb52d4d702d259fed","cat":"fail","type":"irab_challenge","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"الطُّلَّابُ [[حَضَرُوا]]","explanation":"حَضَرُوا = fi'il madhi mabni 'ala adh-dhamm; wawu jama'ah fa'il (mahalli raf'). Jumlah fi'liyyah ini khabar bagi الطُّلَّابُ.","time":30,"options":["Fi'il madhi + wawu jama'ah sebagai fa'il; jumlahnya khabar","Fi'il mudhari' marfu'","Isim marfu' khabar","Fi'il amr"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"3ac11a762d12289c21f129967e1b6674","cat":"maful-bih","type":"irab_challenge","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"قَابَلْتُ [[أَبَاكَ]]","explanation":"أَبَاكَ maf'ul bih; أَبٌ termasuk asmaul khamsah, manshub dengan alif.","time":25,"options":["Maf'ul bih manshub dengan alif karena asmaul khamsah","Maf'ul bih manshub dengan fathah","Fa'il marfu' dengan alif","Isim majrur"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"865ece9e999c521bdf38f50270b89082","cat":"naat","type":"irab_challenge","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"مَرَرْتُ بِرَجُلٍ [[صَالِحٍ]]","explanation":"صَالِحٍ na'at bagi رَجُلٍ (majrur oleh بِـ), maka ikut majrur dengan kasrah.","time":25,"options":["Na'at majrur dengan kasrah","Mudhaf ilaih majrur","Isim majrur oleh huruf jar","Hal manshub"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"79f1d4429147e170a06b354cc997ff9f","cat":"idhafah","type":"irab_challenge","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"[[قَلَمُ]] الْمُعَلِّمِ جَدِيدٌ","explanation":"قَلَمُ mubtada' (marfu') dan mudhaf. الْمُعَلِّمِ mudhaf ilaih, جَدِيدٌ khabar.","time":20,"options":["Mubtada' marfu' dengan dhammah dan mudhaf","Khabar marfu'","Mudhaf ilaih majrur","Fa'il marfu'"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"273ed020b791d880938a7800a20c3e2e","cat":"fail","type":"irab_challenge","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"نَزَلَ [[الثَّلْجُ]]","explanation":"الثَّلْجُ pelaku نَزَلَ, maka fa'il marfu' dengan dhammah.","time":20,"options":["Fa'il marfu' dengan dhammah","Mubtada' marfu' dengan dhammah","Maf'ul bih manshub","Na'at marfu'"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"f5450aae0e35f82c0c02523778c86124","cat":"naat","type":"nahwu_battle","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Pilih na'at yang tepat untuk melengkapi kalimat.","ar":"قَرَأْتُ كُتُبًا ـــــ","explanation":"Man'ut كُتُبًا: manshub, nakirah, jamak tak berakal → na'at muannats mufrad: مُفِيدَةً.","time":25,"options":["مُفِيدَةً","مُفِيدِينَ","مُفِيدَةٌ","الْمُفِيدَةَ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"78a8e28c187ccc149df4c0cd19f73adc","cat":"maful-bih","type":"nahwu_battle","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Pilih maf'ul bih yang tepat untuk melengkapi kalimat.","ar":"يَحْفَظُ الطَّالِبُ ـــــ","explanation":"Maf'ul bih manshub dengan fathah: الْقُرْآنَ.","time":25,"options":["الْقُرْآنَ","الْقُرْآنُ","الْقُرْآنِ","قُرْآنٌ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"b4384951e741cdb1687adaa1adfc3844","cat":"hal","type":"irab_challenge","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"دَخَلَ الْمُعَلِّمُ الْفَصْلَ [[مُبْتَسِمًا]]","explanation":"مُبْتَسِمًا menerangkan keadaan fa'il saat masuk (sambil tersenyum): hal, nakirah, manshub.","time":20,"options":["Hal manshub dengan fathah","Na'at manshub","Maf'ul bih kedua","Tamyiz manshub"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"ffa215b47f3b131287f5cabe54252666","cat":"hal","type":"irab_challenge","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"جَلَسَ الطَّالِبُ [[صَامِتًا]]","explanation":"صَامِتًا = dalam keadaan diam, menerangkan keadaan الطَّالِبُ: hal manshub.","time":20,"options":["Hal manshub dengan fathah","Maf'ul bih manshub","Khabar manshub","Na'at manshub"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"4c26c1ad42d9b98538d4ed4e36daaf7f","cat":"hal","type":"irab_challenge","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"رَجَعَ الْجُنُودُ [[سَالِمِينَ]]","explanation":"سَالِمِينَ menerangkan keadaan الْجُنُودُ (dengan selamat): hal, jamak mudzakkar salim manshub dengan ya'.","time":25,"options":["Hal manshub dengan ya' karena jamak mudzakkar salim","Na'at manshub dengan ya'","Maf'ul bih manshub","Isim majrur"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"e6215a6feb7ea7672eb1e1c5a1e86de1","cat":"hal","type":"irab_challenge","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"وَصَلَتِ الْحَاجَّتَانِ [[مَسْرُورَتَيْنِ]]","explanation":"Hal mutsanna muannats, manshub dengan ya', sesuai shahibul hal الْحَاجَّتَانِ.","time":25,"options":["Hal manshub dengan ya' karena mutsanna","Na'at marfu'","Maf'ul bih manshub","Khabar marfu'"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"8a4b893a037fae77c2dad89cc420ad2e","cat":"hal","type":"irab_challenge","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"جَاءَ الطِّفْلُ [[يَبْكِي]]","explanation":"Jumlah setelah isim ma'rifah (الطِّفْلُ) menjadi hal: datang sambil menangis. Kaidah: الْجُمَلُ بَعْدَ الْمَعَارِفِ أَحْوَالٌ.","time":30,"options":["Jumlah fi'liyyah sebagai hal fi mahalli nashb","Na'at fi mahalli raf'","Khabar fi mahalli raf'","Maf'ul bih"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"2f93db024d25097c351fe9e3c4b1a842","cat":"hal","type":"nahwu_battle","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Pilih hal yang tepat untuk melengkapi kalimat.","ar":"ذَهَبَ أَحْمَدُ إِلَى الْمَدْرَسَةِ ـــــ","explanation":"Hal nakirah, manshub, sesuai shahibul hal (mudzakkar): مَاشِيًا (berjalan kaki).","time":20,"options":["مَاشِيًا","مَاشٍ","الْمَاشِي","مَاشِيَةً"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"f6843f20269bdccff16f869c7d3fba2c","cat":"hal","type":"nahwu_battle","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Pilih hal yang tepat untuk melengkapi kalimat.","ar":"اِسْتَيْقَظَتِ الْبِنْتُ ـــــ","explanation":"Shahibul hal الْبِنْتُ muannats → hal نَشِيطَةً (manshub, nakirah).","time":25,"options":["نَشِيطَةً","نَشِيطًا","نَشِيطَةٌ","النَّشِيطَةَ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"508f8102d8da9eb9f552d2609d1c924c","cat":"hal","type":"nahwu_battle","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Pilih hal yang tepat untuk melengkapi kalimat.","ar":"حَضَرَ الطَّالِبَاتُ ـــــ","explanation":"Hal jamak muannats salim manshub dengan kasrah: مُبَكِّرَاتٍ (datang lebih awal).","time":30,"options":["مُبَكِّرَاتٍ","مُبَكِّرَاتٌ","مُبَكِّرِينَ","الْمُبَكِّرَاتِ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"a207ef18a81dfd6e96a37f60b4de8942","cat":"hal","type":"grammar_detective","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Kalimat manakah yang SALAH? (Perhatikan hal harus nakirah.)","ar":null,"explanation":"Hal wajib nakirah. الرَّاكِبَ (ma'rifah) tidak boleh menjadi hal; yang benar رَاكِبًا.","time":25,"options":["جَاءَ زَيْدٌ الرَّاكِبَ","جَاءَ زَيْدٌ رَاكِبًا","رَجَعَ الْوَلَدُ فَرِحًا","خَرَجَ الْأَبُ مُسْرِعًا"],"