 tamyiz bilangan 3–10.)","ar":null,"explanation":"Tamyiz bilangan 3–10 harus jamak majrur: سَبْعَةُ أَقْلَامٍ. Maka سَبْعَةُ قَلَمٍ salah.","time":25,"options":["عِنْدِي سَبْعَةُ قَلَمٍ","عِنْدِي سَبْعَةُ أَقْلَامٍ","عِنْدِي عِشْرُونَ قَلَمًا","عِنْدِي قَلَمَانِ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"e18f1515c54edd7166977e66d1c97d98","cat":"tamyiz","type":"sentence_analysis","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Jenis tamyiz pada kalimat berikut adalah …","ar":"زَيْدٌ أَحْسَنُ خُلُقًا","explanation":"خُلُقًا menjelaskan sisi kelebihan pada isim tafdhil (lebih baik akhlaknya): tamyiz nisbah/malhuzh.","time":30,"options":["Tamyiz nisbah (menjelaskan sisi penilaian)","Tamyiz bilangan","Tamyiz takaran","Tamyiz ukuran panjang"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"8cbb6f9264cac3df1aebea63be50c49c","cat":"tamyiz","type":"irab_challenge","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"اِشْتَرَيْتُ لِتْرًا [[حَلِيبًا]]","explanation":"حَلِيبًا menjelaskan takaran لِتْرًا (seliter susu): tamyiz, manshub.","time":20,"options":["Tamyiz manshub dengan fathah","Maf'ul bih manshub","Hal manshub","Na'at manshub"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"f3bcc8e051b19029f0a76b0c0a0fcfcd","cat":"nawasikh","type":"irab_challenge","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"كَانَ الطَّقْسُ [[جَمِيلًا]]","explanation":"جَمِيلًا khabar كَانَ, manshub dengan fathah.","time":20,"options":["Khabar kana manshub dengan fathah","Isim kana marfu'","Hal manshub","Maf'ul bih manshub"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"6cddf179795071688db5330081a1d361","cat":"nawasikh","type":"irab_challenge","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"إِنَّ [[الْعِلْمَ]] نُورٌ","explanation":"الْعِلْمَ isim إِنَّ, manshub dengan fathah. نُورٌ khabar inna (marfu').","time":20,"options":["Isim inna manshub dengan fathah","Khabar inna marfu'","Maf'ul bih manshub","Mubtada' marfu'"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"a3526a95c662c8162ee7c01638a28ff7","cat":"nawasikh","type":"irab_challenge","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"إِنَّ الْمُسْلِمِينَ [[إِخْوَةٌ]]","explanation":"إِخْوَةٌ khabar إِنَّ, marfu'. الْمُسْلِمِينَ isim inna manshub dengan ya'.","time":25,"options":["Khabar inna marfu' dengan dhammah","Isim inna manshub","Na'at marfu'","Mubtada' marfu'"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"fcc8734cfdb9da8ff22b243bdf5e2df8","cat":"nawasikh","type":"irab_challenge","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"صَارَ [[الْمَاءُ]] ثَلْجًا","explanation":"صَارَ saudara kana: الْمَاءُ isim-nya (marfu'), ثَلْجًا khabar-nya (manshub).","time":25,"options":["Isim shara marfu' dengan dhammah","Khabar shara manshub","Fa'il marfu'","Mubtada' marfu'"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"ea8b010e6e70ed533113ba861301bc06","cat":"nawasikh","type":"irab_challenge","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"لَكِنَّ [[الْجَوَّ]] حَارٌّ","explanation":"لَكِنَّ saudara inna: الْجَوَّ isim-nya manshub.","time":25,"options":["Isim lakinna manshub dengan fathah","Khabar lakinna marfu'","Mubtada' marfu'","Fa'il marfu'"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"b14215ec8118637499daf0720d805557","cat":"nawasikh","type":"irab_challenge","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"كَانَ الطُّلَّابُ [[يَدْرُسُونَ]]","explanation":"Jumlah يَدْرُسُونَ berkedudukan khabar كَانَ, fi mahalli nashb.","time":30,"options":["Jumlah fi'liyyah sebagai khabar kana fi mahalli nashb","Isim kana","Hal","Na'at"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"5330aa8e0cfcfb83906b9fc4e6e90b08","cat":"nawasikh","type":"irab_challenge","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"عَلِمْتُ اللّٰهَ [[غَفُورًا]]","explanation":"عَلِمَ (yakin) termasuk zhanna wa akhawatuha, me-nashab-kan dua maf'ul: اللّٰهَ (pertama), غَفُورًا (kedua).","time":30,"options":["Maf'ul bih kedua manshub","Hal manshub","Khabar kana","Na'at manshub"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"9f671c0bd48421623568fb6f6c0633eb","cat":"nawasikh","type":"nahwu_battle","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Pilih bentuk yang benar untuk melengkapi kalimat.","ar":"كَانَ الْبَابُ ـــــ","explanation":"Khabar kana manshub: مُغْلَقًا.","time":20,"options":["مُغْلَقًا","مُغْلَقٌ","مُغْلَقٍ","الْمُغْلَقُ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"90afb21c1c834600d52c8a9a5ef12490","cat":"nawasikh","type":"nahwu_battle","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Pilih bentuk yang benar untuk melengkapi kalimat.","ar":"إِنَّ ـــــ مُجْتَهِدَاتٌ","explanation":"Isim inna manshub; jamak muannats salim manshub dengan kasrah: الطَّالِبَاتِ.","time":25,"options":["الطَّالِبَاتِ","الطَّالِبَاتُ","الطَّالِبَاتَ","طَالِبَاتٌ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"854d6198316d98b4f4362d60419ca217","cat":"nawasikh","type":"nahwu_battle","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Pilih bentuk yang benar untuk melengkapi kalimat.","ar":"أَصْبَحَ الْجَوُّ ـــــ","explanation":"أَصْبَحَ saudara kana: khabarnya manshub: بَارِدًا.","time":30,"options":["بَارِدًا","بَارِدٌ","بَارِدٍ","الْبَارِدُ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"22562a0cc10621e794857cad613f6703","cat":"nawasikh","type":"grammar_detective","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Kalimat manakah yang SALAH? (Perhatikan khabar kana.)","ar":null,"explanation":"Khabar kana manshub: كَانَ الطَّالِبُ مُجْتَهِدًا. Maka مُجْتَهِدٌ (marfu') salah.","time":25,"options":["كَانَ الطَّالِبُ مُجْتَهِدٌ","كَانَ الطَّالِبُ مُجْتَهِدًا","إِنَّ الطَّالِبَ مُجْتَهِدٌ","لَيْسَ الطَّالِبُ كَسُولًا"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"fd22a8bfebf73fb8d354dcfed8d11093","cat":"nawasikh","type":"sentence_analysis","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Termasuk kelompok apakah huruf/kata yang menashab-kan isim dan me-rafa'-kan khabar ini?","ar":"لَيْتَ الشَّبَابَ يَعُودُ","explanation":"لَيْتَ (angan-angan) termasuk saudara إِنَّ: me-nashab-kan isim (الشَّبَابَ) dan me-rafa'-kan khabar.","time":30,"options":["Inna wa akhawatuha","Kana wa akhawatuha","Zhanna wa akhawatuha","Huruf jar"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"07f6246109920dc288c28dfb6b153d98","cat":"majrurat","type":"irab_challenge","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"سَافَرْتُ إِلَى [[الْقَاهِرَةِ]]","explanation":"إِلَى huruf jar, maka الْقَاهِرَةِ majrur dengan kasrah.","time":20,"options":["Isim majrur dengan kasrah karena huruf jar","Mudhaf ilaih majrur","Maf'ul bih manshub","Na'at majrur"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"dc7efa9cb0a8c4a9cf6dbb7ac71fa2e7","cat":"majrurat","type":"irab_challenge","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"سَلَّمْتُ عَلَى [[الْمُعَلِّمَاتِ]]","explanation":"الْمُعَلِّمَاتِ majrur oleh عَلَى, tandanya kasrah.","time":25,"options":["Isim majrur dengan kasrah (jamak muannats salim)","Maf'ul bih manshub dengan kasrah","Mudhaf ilaih","Na'at majrur"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"39549761471760354dc74478d2c2513b","cat":"majrurat","type":"irab_challenge","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"ذَهَبْتُ إِلَى [[مَكَّةَ]]","explanation":"مَكَّةَ nama tempat muannats (mamnu' min ash-sharf), di-jarr-kan dengan fathah.","time":25,"options":["Isim majrur dengan fathah karena mamnu' min ash-sharf","Isim majrur dengan kasrah","Maf'ul bih manshub","Badal"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"84dc8af2ba63bdccfb5a92ffb8372ec1","cat":"majrurat","type":"irab_challenge","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"مَرَرْتُ بِـ[[الْقَاضِي]]","explanation":"الْقَاضِي isim manqush; kasrah pada ya' tidak ditampakkan karena berat (tsiqal): kasrah muqaddarah.","time":30,"options":["Isim majrur dengan kasrah muqaddarah","Isim majrur dengan kasrah zhahirah","Isim majrur dengan ya'","Maf'ul bih"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"1fc391890e5749d189896e5d321f59f6","cat":"majrurat","type":"irab_challenge","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"سَمِعْتُ عَنْ [[الْمَسَاجِدِ]] الْقَدِيمَةِ","explanation":"مَسَاجِدُ mamnu' min ash-sharf, tetapi karena diberi ال, ia kembali di-jarr-kan dengan kasrah.","time":30,"options":["Isim majrur dengan kasrah (mamnu' min ash-sharf yang diberi ال)","Isim majrur dengan fathah","Mudhaf ilaih majrur","Maf'ul bih manshub"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"2989b0516196af17f8d5485b4b3210c1","cat":"majrurat","type":"nahwu_battle","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Pilih bentuk yang benar untuk melengkapi kalimat.","ar":"جَلَسْتُ عَلَى ـــــ","explanation":"Setelah huruf jar عَلَى, isimnya majrur: الْكُرْسِيِّ.","time":20,"options":["الْكُرْسِيِّ","الْكُرْسِيُّ","الْكُرْسِيَّ","كُرْسِيٌّ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"1b29f950c8589b5aadff28b7aab1328c","cat":"majrurat","type":"nahwu_battle","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Pilih bentuk yang benar untuk melengkapi kalimat.","ar":"تَعَلَّمْتُ مِنْ ـــــ","explanation":"أَبٌ (asmaul khamsah) majrur dengan ya': مِنْ أَبِيكَ.","time":25,"options":["أَبِيكَ","أَبُوكَ","أَبَاكَ","أَبٌ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"54590a649e8c1f852f08ff91b4349f5f","cat":"majrurat","type":"grammar_detective","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Kalimat manakah yang SALAH? (Perhatikan isim setelah huruf jar.)","ar":null,"explanation":"Isim setelah huruf jar harus majrur: إِلَى الْمَدْرَسَةِ.","time":25,"options":["ذَهَبْتُ إِلَى الْمَدْرَسَةُ","ذَهَبْتُ إِلَى الْمَدْ