 dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"أَعْجَبَنِي الطَّالِبُ [[أَدَبُهُ]]","explanation":"أَدَبُهُ adalah sifat yang tercakup pada الطَّالِبُ: badal isytimal, mengikuti marfu' dan wajib memuat dhamir.","time":30,"options":["Badal isytimal marfu' dengan dhammah","Na'at marfu'","Taukid marfu'","Khabar marfu'"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"fb6a3a8ef1a1d62c291324dd2e9a50cb","cat":"tawabi","type":"irab_challenge","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"مَرَرْتُ بِالطُّلَّابِ [[كُلِّهِمْ]]","explanation":"كُلِّهِمْ menguatkan الطُّلَّابِ (majrur oleh بِـ), maka taukid majrur.","time":30,"options":["Taukid ma'nawi majrur dengan kasrah","Badal majrur","Na'at majrur","Mudhaf ilaih"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"52d2aa4b9becb465174a4f264e75a755","cat":"tawabi","type":"nahwu_battle","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Pilih ma'thuf yang tepat untuk melengkapi kalimat.","ar":"اِشْتَرَيْتُ قَلَمًا وَـــــ","explanation":"Ma'thuf mengikuti قَلَمًا yang manshub: كِتَابًا.","time":20,"options":["كِتَابًا","كِتَابٌ","كِتَابٍ","الْكِتَابُ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"8e5f0876abb57ee44b4f86d1d7d625d6","cat":"tawabi","type":"nahwu_battle","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Pilih ma'thuf yang tepat untuk melengkapi kalimat.","ar":"سَلَّمْتُ عَلَى الْمُدِيرِ وَـــــ","explanation":"Ma'thuf mengikuti الْمُدِيرِ yang majrur; jamak mudzakkar salim majrur dengan ya': الْمُعَلِّمِينَ.","time":25,"options":["الْمُعَلِّمِينَ","الْمُعَلِّمُونَ","مُعَلِّمُونَ","الْمُعَلِّمُ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"f2c20d29584943836239b15f4752ac62","cat":"tawabi","type":"nahwu_battle","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Pilih badal yang tepat untuk melengkapi kalimat.","ar":"قَرَأْتُ الْكِتَابَ ـــــ","explanation":"Badal ba'dh min kull mengikuti الْكِتَابَ (manshub) dan memuat dhamir: ثُلُثَهُ.","time":30,"options":["ثُلُثَهُ","ثُلُثُهُ","ثُلُثِهِ","الثُّلُثَ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"19d72318db0320bf5385f5c75aac3e68","cat":"tawabi","type":"grammar_detective","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Kalimat manakah yang SALAH? (Perhatikan i'rab ma'thuf.)","ar":null,"explanation":"Ma'thuf mengikuti ma'thuf 'alaih: أَحْمَدُ marfu' → عَلِيٌّ marfu'. Maka وَعَلِيًّا salah.","time":30,"options":["جَاءَ أَحْمَدُ وَعَلِيًّا","جَاءَ أَحْمَدُ وَعَلِيٌّ","رَأَيْتُ أَحْمَدَ وَعَلِيًّا","مَرَرْتُ بِأَحْمَدَ وَعَلِيٍّ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"70e8d8934d83e147861f301319a86120","cat":"tawabi","type":"sentence_analysis","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Ada berapa macam tawabi' (kata yang mengikuti i'rab kata sebelumnya)?","ar":null,"explanation":"Tawabi' ada empat: na'at, 'athaf, taukid, dan badal. Hal dan tamyiz bukan tawabi'.","time":25,"options":["Empat: na'at, 'athaf, taukid, badal","Dua: na'at dan 'athaf","Tiga: na'at, hal, tamyiz","Lima: na'at, 'athaf, taukid, badal, hal"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"78f88a6e59a14abb2173cd0ef0c24b83","cat":"tawabi","type":"sentence_analysis","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Huruf 'athaf manakah yang bermakna urutan tanpa jeda waktu?","ar":null,"explanation":"الْفَاءُ = urutan langsung (tartib dan ta'qib). ثُمَّ = urutan dengan jeda, أَوْ = pilihan, بَلْ = peralihan.","time":30,"options":["الْفَاءُ","ثُمَّ","أَوْ","بَلْ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"5e0cdd3a88bde272cb95db25d801e63b","cat":"anwa-jumal","type":"sentence_analysis","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Termasuk jenis jumlah apakah kalimat ini?","ar":"الْعِلْمُ مِفْتَاحُ النَّجَاحِ","explanation":"Diawali isim (الْعِلْمُ, mubtada'), maka jumlah ismiyyah.","time":20,"options":["Jumlah ismiyyah","Jumlah fi'liyyah","Syibhu jumlah"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"3f2ff6abb349c5df6bcf40cdb0d351b8","cat":"anwa-jumal","type":"sentence_analysis","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Termasuk jenis jumlah apakah kalimat ini?","ar":"سَافَرَ أَبِي أَمْسِ","explanation":"Diawali fi'il (سَافَرَ), maka jumlah fi'liyyah.","time":20,"options":["Jumlah fi'liyyah","Jumlah ismiyyah","Syibhu jumlah"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"fc5864bf12bb05af0bfaf8b3986d3817","cat":"anwa-jumal","type":"sentence_analysis","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Termasuk jenis jumlah apakah kalimat ini?","ar":"اِجْلِسْ هُنَا","explanation":"Diawali fi'il amr (اِجْلِسْ) dengan fa'il dhamir mustatir: jumlah fi'liyyah.","time":25,"options":["Jumlah fi'liyyah","Jumlah ismiyyah","Syibhu jumlah"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"aca6387ad6d7087c6b78383382dd7e12","cat":"anwa-jumal","type":"sentence_analysis","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Termasuk jenis jumlah apakah kalimat ini?","ar":"إِنَّ اللّٰهَ غَفُورٌ رَحِيمٌ","explanation":"إِنَّ masuk pada jumlah ismiyyah (mubtada' dan khabar); kalimat tetap jumlah ismiyyah.","time":30,"options":["Jumlah ismiyyah (didahului inna)","Jumlah fi'liyyah","Syibhu jumlah"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"ad79399fff1ac9e99cf0d0362420c888","cat":"anwa-jumal","type":"sentence_analysis","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Termasuk apakah susunan berikut?","ar":"عِنْدَ الْبَابِ","explanation":"عِنْدَ (zharaf) + الْبَابِ (mudhaf ilaih) disebut syibhu jumlah zharfiyyah.","time":30,"options":["Syibhu jumlah (zharaf + mudhaf ilaih)","Jumlah ismiyyah","Jumlah fi'liyyah"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"4917608c4cdea5523f0995b32c4f96fe","cat":"anwa-jumal","type":"identify_word","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Kata yang ditandai termasuk jenis kalimah apa?","ar":"[[قَلَمٌ]] جَدِيدٌ","explanation":"قَلَمٌ menerima tanwin, maka isim.","time":20,"options":["Isim","Fi'il","Huruf"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"760244d316bcb3d24297267639b052d8","cat":"anwa-jumal","type":"identify_word","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Kata yang ditandai termasuk jenis kalimah apa?","ar":"[[جَلَسَ]] الْوَلَدُ","explanation":"جَلَسَ menunjukkan perbuatan di masa lampau: fi'il madhi.","time":20,"options":["Fi'il","Isim","Huruf"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"2e21f6c58817cdba794b9bbfdf1931ad","cat":"anwa-jumal","type":"identify_word","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Kata yang ditandai termasuk jenis kalimah apa?","ar":"[[لَمْ]] يَذْهَبْ","explanation":"لَمْ adalah huruf (huruf nafyi dan jazm).","time":25,"options":["Huruf","Isim","Fi'il"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"d8c6ac22dab4a4dfa7f12f166e7198af","cat":"anwa-jumal","type":"identify_word","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Kata yang ditandai termasuk jenis kalimah apa?","ar":"ذَهَبْتُ [[أَمْسِ]]","explanation":"أَمْسِ adalah isim (zharaf zaman yang mabni 'ala al-kasr).","time":25,"options":["Isim","Fi'il","Huruf"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"8b20368e9a580c33b4604e2fd9a236b4","cat":"anwa-jumal","type":"identify_word","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Kata yang ditandai termasuk jenis kalimah apa?","ar":"[[عَسَى]] اللّٰهُ أَنْ يَرْحَمَنَا","explanation":"عَسَى adalah fi'il madhi jamid (af'al ar-raja'), menerima ta' fa'il: عَسَيْتُ.","time":30,"options":["Fi'il","Huruf","Isim"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"9088fcaed11564052846801bc262cb8b","cat":"anwa-jumal","type":"identify_word","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Kata yang ditandai termasuk jenis kalimah apa?","ar":"[[مَتَى]] تُسَافِرُ؟","explanation":"مَتَى adalah isim istifham (menanyakan waktu), termasuk isim mabni.","time":30,"options":["Isim","Huruf","Fi'il"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"13cdfc3ed1f43c17d23266f5f661c96d","cat":"anwa-jumal","type":"complete_rule","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Manakah yang termasuk tanda-tanda isim?","ar":null,"explanation":"Tanda isim: ال, tanwin, jarr, dan nida'. Tanda fi'il: قَدْ, sin, saufa, ta' ta'nits sakinah, ta' fa'il, dll.","time":25,"options":["Menerima ال dan tanwin","Menerima ta' fa'il dan sin","Menerima قَدْ dan لَمْ","Menerima nun taukid"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"8ade2d6a84245978e47dcc4d17e19d14","cat":"madhi","type":"fiil_challenge","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Kata ini termasuk fi'il apa?","ar":"فَهِمَ","explanation":"فَهِمَ fi'il madhi (lampau), diakhiri fathah, tanpa huruf mudhara'ah.","time":20,"options":["Fi'il madhi","Fi'il mudhari'","Fi'il amr"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"c3e16d090535265af66bd8fa9f6f4d4b","cat":"madhi","type":"fiil_challenge","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Kata ini termasuk fi'il apa?","ar":"اِسْتَخْرَجُوا","explanation":"اِسْتَخْرَجُوا = mereka telah mengeluarkan (madhi + wawu jama'ah). Amr-nya اِسْتَخْرِجُوا (dengan kasrah pada ra').","time":25,"options":["Fi'il madhi","Fi'il amr","Fi'il mudhari'"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"672eb2c7e86c4a3473014dcd513568a9","cat":"madhi","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Ubah نَصَرَ untuk dhamir هِيَ.","ar":null,"explanation":"هِيَ → ta' ta'nits sakinah: نَصَرَتْ. نَصَرْتُ untuk أَنَا, نَصَرْنَ untuk هُنَّ, نَصَرْتِ untuk أَنْتِ.","time":20,"options":["نَصَرَتْ","نَصَرْتُ","نَصَرْنَ","نَصَرْتِ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"37d483e1894f787450971bbcc48cf6c1","cat":"madhi","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Ubah سَمِعَ untuk dhamir أَنْتَ.","ar":null,"explanation":"أَنْتَ → ta' fa'il berharakat fathah: سَمِعْتَ.","time":20,"options":["سَمِعْتَ","سَمِعْتُ","سَمِعَتْ","سَمِعْنَا"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"23a96489f0293b4da253523e0fc2de29","cat":"madhi","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Ubah فَهِمَ untuk dhamir أَنْتُمْ.","ar":null,"explanation":"أَنْتُمْ → تُمْ: فَهِمْتُمْ. فَهِمُوا untuk هُمْ, فَهِمْتُنَّ untuk أَنْتُنَّ.","time":25,"options":["فَهِمْتُمْ","فَهِمُوا","فَهِمْتُنَّ","فَهِمْنَا"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"42ba3316e0e1559d2417912354268f1c","cat":"madhi","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Ubah قَرَأَ untuk dhamir هُمَا (dua perempuan).","ar":null,"explanation":"هُمَا muannats → ta' ta'nits + alif itsnain: قَرَأَتَا. قَرَأَا untuk هُمَا mudzakkar.","time":25,"options":["قَرَأَتَا","قَرَأَا","قَرَأْتُمَا","قَرَأْنَ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"4daa478c4100bbbd097bec6ffef00473","cat":"madhi","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Ubah نَامَ untuk dhamir أَنَا.","ar":null,"explanation":"نَامَ asalnya نَوِمَ (bab فَعِلَ, mudhari' يَنَامُ). Saat bersambung ta' fa'il, alif dibuang dan fa' dikasrah: نِمْتُ.","time":30,"options":["نِمْتُ","نُمْتُ","نَامْتُ","نَوَمْتُ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"418c3358c43a3bcad64ea362e5a935e6","cat":"madhi","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Ubah رَمَى untuk dhamir هُمْ.","ar":null,"explanation":"رَمَى naqish ya'i: untuk هُمْ, huruf illat dibuang dan fathah sebelum wawu tetap: رَمَوْا.","time":30,"options":["رَمَوْا","رَمَيُوا","رَمُوا","رَمَاوُا"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"187bfbdd674a4150c803490382becece","cat":"mudhari","type":"fiil_challenge","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Kata ini termasuk fi'il apa?","ar":"تَذْهَبِينَ","explanation":"تَذْهَبِينَ diawali huruf mudhara'ah تَـ dengan ya' mukhathabah: fi'il mudhari' untuk أَنْتِ.","time":20,"options":["Fi'il mudhari'","Fi'il madhi","Fi'il amr"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"60f09fe6aa186ee0b472330e47abec4a","cat":"mudhari","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa fi'il mudhari' dari فَتَحَ untuk dhamir نَحْنُ?","ar":null,"explanation":"نَحْنُ → huruf mudhara'ah نَـ: نَفْتَحُ (bab فَعَلَ – يَفْعَلُ).","time":20,"options":["نَفْتَحُ","يَفْتَحُ","أَفْتَحُ","تَفْتَحُ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"b92cec5c06ffdf77186297416ed69ded","cat":"mudhari","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa fi'il mudhari' dari سَمِعَ untuk dhamir هُوَ?","ar":null,"explanation":"سَمِعَ – يَسْمَعُ (bab فَعِلَ – يَفْعَلُ).","time":20,"options":["يَسْمَعُ","يَسْمِعُ","يَسْمُعُ","تَسْمَعُ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"605ffc8bc0ab163452540ffea1239896","cat":"mudhari","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa fi'il mudhari' dari جَلَسَ untuk dhamir هُمْ?","ar":null,"explanation":"هُمْ → يَـ + wawu jama'ah + nun: يَجْلِسُونَ.","time":25,"options":["يَجْلِسُونَ","تَجْلِسُونَ","يَجْلِسْنَ","يَجْلِسَانِ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"3c36a7026efe1cf9cc036ade1a277780","cat":"mudhari","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa fi'il mudhari' dari كَتَبَ untuk dhamir أَنْتُنَّ?","ar":null,"explanation":"أَنْتُنَّ → تَـ + nun niswah: تَكْتُبْنَ. Bentuknya sama dengan هُنَّ tetapi huruf awalnya ta'.","time":25,"options":["تَكْتُبْنَ","يَكْتُبْنَ","تَكْتُبُونَ","تَكْتُبِينَ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"145131a89ce9b40f6fb9de08bae05cb3","cat":"mudhari","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa fi'il mudhari' dari وَصَلَ untuk dhamir هُوَ?","ar":null,"explanation":"Mitsal wawi berbab فَعَلَ – يَفْعِلُ: wawu dibuang pada mudhari': وَصَلَ – يَصِلُ.","time":30,"options":["يَصِلُ","يَوْصِلُ","يُوصِلُ","يَوْصُلُ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"e929616b771c3e067871378db8739d6a","cat":"mudhari","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa fi'il mudhari' dari أَحْسَنَ untuk dhamir هُوَ?","ar":null,"explanation":"أَحْسَنَ (أَفْعَلَ) → يُفْعِلُ: يُحْسِنُ. يُحَسِّنُ dari حَسَّنَ, يَتَحَسَّنُ dari تَحَسَّنَ.","time":30,"options":["يُحْسِنُ","يَحْسُنُ","يُحَسِّنُ","يَتَحَسَّنُ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"0eb42e47028549fc68cd52bc665aae45","cat":"mudhari","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa fi'il mudhari' dari رَأَى untuk dhamir هُوَ?","ar":null,"explanation":"رَأَى – يَرَى: hamzah 'ain fi'il dibuang dalam mudhari' (asal يَرْأَى). يُرِي adalah mudhari' أَرَى (memperlihatkan).","time":30,"options":["يَرَى","يَرْأَى","يَرِي","يُرِي"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"4ed0a99924ac4c0d7d5cdb769c8ce0c8","cat":"amr","type":"fiil_challenge","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Kata ini termasuk fi'il apa?","ar":"اُكْتُبُوا","explanation":"اُكْتُبُوا = tulislah kalian (amr untuk أَنْتُمْ), diawali hamzah washl berdhammah.","time":20,"options":["Fi'il amr","Fi'il madhi","Fi'il mudhari'"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"ab1761994ab9e1a7cac5f91da98b7786","cat":"amr","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa fi'il amr dari يَدْرُسُ (untuk أَنْتَ)?","ar":null,"explanation":"'Ain fi'il dhammah → hamzah washl berdhammah: اُدْرُسْ.","time":20,"options":["اُدْرُسْ","اِدْرِسْ","دْرُسْ","تَدْرُسْ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"e8483ebd2d17648d153debd27d23bf60","cat":"amr","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa fi'il amr dari يَسْمَعُ (untuk أَنْتَ)?","ar":null,"explanation":"'Ain fi'il fathah → hamzah washl berkasrah: اِسْمَعْ.","time":20,"options":["اِسْمَعْ","اُسْمُعْ","سْمَعْ","تَسْمَعْ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"c6d4b7a42db7e23939a61c8ef06eafc2","cat":"amr","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa fi'il amr dari يَجْلِسُ untuk dhamir أَنْتُمَا?","ar":null,"explanation":"Amr untuk أَنْتُمَا: buang huruf mudhara'ah dan nun: اِجْلِسَا.","time":25,"options":["اِجْلِسَا","اِجْلِسُوا","اِجْلِسِي","اِجْلِسْنَ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"e8803f6f4279ccd72300ee60d7567322","cat":"amr","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa fi'il amr dari يُكْرِمُ (untuk أَنْتَ)?","ar":null,"explanation":"Dari أَكْرَمَ (أَفْعَلَ): amr dengan hamzah qath' berharakat fathah: أَكْرِمْ.","time":25,"options":["أَكْرِمْ","اِكْرِمْ","كْرِمْ","أُكْرِمْ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"723a34bece0ae3cf2c58f9d190945846","cat":"amr","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa fi'il amr dari يَرْمِي (untuk أَنْتَ)?","ar":null,"explanation":"Naqish ya'i: buang huruf illat di akhir: اِرْمِ (hamzah washl berkasrah).","time":30,"options":["اِرْمِ","اِرْمِي","اُرْمُ","رْمِ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"3a284f47a8c044a3bb721acc96bcb6b0","cat":"amr","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa fi'il amr dari يَصِلُ (untuk أَنْتَ)?","ar":null,"explanation":"يَصِلُ (mitsal wawi tanpa wawu) → buang huruf mudhara'ah: صِلْ, tanpa hamzah washl.","time":30,"options":["صِلْ","اِصِلْ","وَصِلْ","اُوصُلْ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"c2df100bb254fc23e5155bf312d87af2","cat":"mashdar","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa mashdar dari كَتَبَ?","ar":null,"explanation":"Mashdar كَتَبَ: كِتَابَةٌ (juga كَتْبٌ). مَكْتُوبٌ isim maf'ul, كَاتِبٌ isim fa'il, مَكْتَبٌ isim makan.","time":20,"options":["كِتَابَةٌ","مَكْتُوبٌ","كَاتِبٌ","مَكْتَبٌ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"f0a92b731ec17fd58e1fc9af472325e8","cat":"mashdar","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa mashdar dari نَصَرَ?","ar":null,"explanation":"Mashdar نَصَرَ: نَصْرٌ. اِنْتِصَارٌ mashdar اِنْتَصَرَ.","time":20,"options":["نَصْرٌ","نَاصِرٌ","مَنْصُورٌ","اِنْتِصَارٌ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"900149e9c413021a4bdcc1dd5152bd9e","cat":"mashdar","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa mashdar dari دَرَّسَ?","ar":null,"explanation":"دَرَّسَ (فَعَّلَ) → mashdar تَفْعِيلٌ: تَدْرِيسٌ (pengajaran). تَدَارُسٌ mashdar تَدَارَسَ.","time":25,"options":["تَدْرِيسٌ","دِرَاسَةٌ","مُدَرِّسٌ","تَدَارُسٌ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"10bd5a849d26814af9723cd55728558d","cat":"mashdar","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa mashdar dari شَاهَدَ?","ar":null,"explanation":"شَاهَدَ (فَاعَلَ) → مُفَاعَلَةٌ: مُشَاهَدَةٌ. شَهَادَةٌ mashdar شَهِدَ.","time":25,"options":["مُشَاهَدَةٌ","شُهُودٌ","شَهَادَةٌ","اِسْتِشْهَادٌ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"4a7d987b19659a24afaa21a098224edb","cat":"mashdar","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa mashdar dari اِسْتَقْبَلَ?","ar":null,"explanation":"اِسْتَقْبَلَ (اِسْتَفْعَلَ) → اِسْتِفْعَالٌ: اِسْتِقْبَالٌ (penyambutan).","time":30,"options":["اِسْتِقْبَالٌ","قُبُولٌ","مُقَابَلَةٌ","تَقَبُّلٌ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"dbee9f3f6dad56229e677bf644f2378f","cat":"mashdar","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa mashdar dari أَقَامَ?","ar":null,"explanation":"أَقَامَ (أَفْعَلَ, ajwaf) → mashdar إِفْعَالٌ yang mengalami i'lal: إِقَامَةٌ (ta' sebagai ganti huruf yang dibuang).","time":30,"options":["إِقَامَةٌ","إِقْوَامٌ","قِيَامٌ","مُقَامٌ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"db36e796cae0b859269ba0607af38041","cat":"isim-fail","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa isim fa'il dari سَمِعَ?","ar":null,"explanation":"Isim fa'il tsulatsi: فَاعِلٌ → سَامِعٌ (pendengar). سَمِيعٌ adalah shighah mubalaghah.","time":20,"options":["سَامِعٌ","مَسْمُوعٌ","سَمْعٌ","سَمِيعٌ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"cadc12367c7551080a0de81176de0c87","cat":"isim-fail","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa isim fa'il dari عَلَّمَ?","ar":null,"explanation":"Dari يُعَلِّمُ → مُعَلِّمٌ (kasrah sebelum akhir). مُعَلَّمٌ isim maf'ul, مُتَعَلِّمٌ isim fa'il dari تَعَلَّمَ.","time":25,"options":["مُعَلِّمٌ","مُعَلَّمٌ","عَالِمٌ","مُتَعَلِّمٌ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"1e6f4670f27173533dddb64173401c85","cat":"isim-fail","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa isim fa'il dari تَعَلَّمَ?","ar":null,"explanation":"Dari يَتَعَلَّمُ → ganti يَـ dengan مُـ dan kasrahkan huruf sebelum akhir: مُتَعَلِّمٌ (pelajar).","time":25,"options":["مُتَعَلِّمٌ","مُعَلِّمٌ","مُتَعَلَّمٌ","تَعَلُّمٌ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"2848dc9bf2d8a3217bb42a3d76b1aea8","cat":"isim-fail","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa isim fa'il dari بَاعَ?","ar":null,"explanation":"فَاعِلٌ dari بَيَعَ: ya' setelah alif tambahan diganti hamzah: بَائِعٌ (penjual).","time":30,"options":["بَائِعٌ","بَايِعٌ","مَبِيعٌ","بَيِّعٌ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"d7ae727f835d3fd5a39b0d590812c709","cat":"isim-fail","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa isim fa'il dari رَمَى?","ar":null,"explanation":"Isim fa'il naqish: رَامٍ (asal رَامِيٌ), ya' dibuang saat bertanwin rafa'/jarr. مَرْمِيٌّ isim maf'ul.","time":30,"options":["رَامٍ","رَامِيٌ","مَرْمِيٌّ","رَمْيٌ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"e5036f6b0de87be0b85f28ef463c103d","cat":"isim-fail","type":"complete_rule","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Isim fa'il dari fi'il lebih dari tiga huruf dibentuk dari mudhari' dengan cara …","ar":null,"explanation":"Contoh: يُكْرِمُ → مُكْرِمٌ, يَسْتَخْرِجُ → مُسْتَخْرِجٌ. Jika huruf sebelum akhir difathah, hasilnya isim maf'ul.","time":25,"options":["Mengganti huruf mudhara'ah dengan mim berdhammah dan mengkasrahkan huruf sebelum akhir","Mengganti huruf mudhara'ah dengan mim berfathah","Menambahkan alif setelah huruf pertama","Mengfathahkan huruf sebelum akhir"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"029c4065d31b84e97572863b9a4c5469","cat":"isim-maful","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa isim maf'ul dari سَمِعَ?","ar":null,"explanation":"Isim maf'ul tsulatsi: مَفْعُولٌ → مَسْمُوعٌ (yang didengar). سَمِيعٌ shighah mubalaghah, سَمَاعٌ mashdar.","time":20,"options":["مَسْمُوعٌ","سَامِعٌ","سَمِيعٌ","سَمَاعٌ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"cf36ab6076fbe920192d71372bd8e437","cat":"isim-maful","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa isim maf'ul dari فَتَحَ?","ar":null,"explanation":"مَفْعُولٌ → مَفْتُوحٌ (yang dibuka).","time":20,"options":["مَفْتُوحٌ","فَاتِحٌ","مِفْتَاحٌ","فُتُوحٌ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"ac54fcd4221b859168adbc7886fdd3f2","cat":"isim-maful","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa isim maf'ul dari اِحْتَرَمَ?","ar":null,"explanation":"Dari يَحْتَرِمُ → مُـ + fathah sebelum akhir: مُحْتَرَمٌ (yang dihormati).","time":25,"options":["مُحْتَرَمٌ","مُحْتَرِمٌ","حَرَامٌ","اِحْتِرَامٌ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"f8661ae36a17185af8f6ffdf389987b1","cat":"isim-maful","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa isim maf'ul dari اِسْتَعْمَلَ?","ar":null,"explanation":"Dari يَسْتَعْمِلُ → مُسْتَعْمَلٌ (yang dipakai). مُسْتَعْمِلٌ (kasrah) = pemakai.","time":25,"options":["مُسْتَعْمَلٌ","مُسْتَعْمِلٌ","عَامِلٌ","اِسْتِعْمَالٌ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"797c00a89429736ddd8e92b0e4b5a826","cat":"isim-maful","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa isim maf'ul dari رَمَى?","ar":null,"explanation":"مَفْعُولٌ dari رَمَيَ: مَرْمُويٌ → i'lal menjadi مَرْمِيٌّ (yang dilempar).","time":30,"options":["مَرْمِيٌّ","مَرْمُوٌّ","رَامٍ","مَرْمًى"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"24cb59ed9b1ff3f0712f1e1ec4845e80","cat":"isim-maful","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa isim maf'ul dari دَعَا?","ar":null,"explanation":"مَفْعُولٌ dari دَعَوَ: مَدْعُووٌ → wawu di-idgham-kan: مَدْعُوٌّ (yang diundang).","time":30,"options":["مَدْعُوٌّ","مَدْعِيٌّ","دَاعٍ","مُدَّعًى"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"77bbdbf193f8355803417c6e9e2e73a8","cat":"tashrif","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Fi'il نَصَرَ – يَنْصُرُ termasuk bab apa?","ar":null,"explanation":"نَصَرَ – يَنْصُرُ: bab pertama (فَعَلَ – يَفْعُلُ).","time":25,"options":["فَعَلَ – يَفْعُلُ","فَعَلَ – يَفْعِلُ","فَعَلَ – يَفْعَلُ","فَعِلَ – يَفْعَلُ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"0c213def4a9aa6ab603e0354a07357f6","cat":"tashrif","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Fi'il ضَرَبَ – يَضْرِبُ termasuk bab apa?","ar":null,"explanation":"ضَرَبَ – يَضْرِبُ: bab kedua (فَعَلَ – يَفْعِلُ).","time":25,"options":["فَعَلَ – يَفْعِلُ","فَعَلَ – يَفْعُلُ","فَعِلَ – يَفْعِلُ","فَعُلَ – يَفْعُلُ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"7ac99ebf621781ea435fd7d08c82481e","cat":"tashrif","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Fi'il حَسِبَ – يَحْسِبُ termasuk bab apa?","ar":null,"explanation":"حَسِبَ – يَحْسِبُ (mengira): bab keenam (فَعِلَ – يَفْعِلُ), bab yang jarang.","time":30,"options":["فَعِلَ – يَفْعِلُ","فَعِلَ – يَفْعَلُ","فَعَلَ – يَفْعِلُ","فَعُلَ – يَفْعُلُ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"3db566f886dfadb7628f79265f497eae","cat":"tashrif","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Lengkapi tashrif ishthilahi: فَتَحَ – يَفْتَحُ – فَتْحًا – فَاتِحٌ – مَفْتُوحٌ – … (amr)","ar":null,"explanation":"Amr dari يَفْتَحُ: اِفْتَحْ (hamzah washl berkasrah karena 'ain mudhari' fathah).","time":30,"options":["اِفْتَحْ","اُفْتُحْ","فْتَحْ","لَا تَفْتَحْ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"96aded1b51a442a6ad25a001702b3cff","cat":"tashrif","type":"complete_rule","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Dalam tashrif lughawi fi'il madhi, ada berapa bentuk dhamir?","ar":null,"explanation":"Tashrif lughawi madhi/mudhari' mencakup 14 dhamir: هُوَ، هُمَا، هُمْ، هِيَ، هُمَا، هُنَّ، أَنْتَ، أَنْتُمَا، أَنْتُمْ، أَنْتِ، أَنْتُمَا، أَنْتُنَّ، أَنَا، نَحْنُ.","time":25,"options":["14","12","10","8"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"6caac21f09c22b6702fa356e0b21681d","cat":"tashrif","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa isim makan dari جَلَسَ?","ar":null,"explanation":"Isim makan dari fi'il yang mudhari'-nya berkasrah ('ain) berwazan مَفْعِلٌ: مَجْلِسٌ (tempat duduk/majelis).","time":30,"options":["مَجْلِسٌ","مِجْلَسٌ","جُلُوسٌ","جَالِسٌ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"1abba79dfa1830fd094127e6b67fa1eb","cat":"mizan","type":"complete_rule","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa mizan sharfi (wazan) kata berikut?","ar":"عَالِمٌ","explanation":"Huruf asli ع–ل–م; alif tambahan setelah huruf pertama: فَاعِلٌ.","time":20,"options":["فَاعِلٌ","فَعِيلٌ","مَفْعُولٌ","فَعَّالٌ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"c3ffd207ab158519d9e6ed3c3d93f218","cat":"mizan","type":"complete_rule","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa mizan sharfi (wazan) kata berikut?","ar":"اِجْتَمَعَ","explanation":"Huruf asli ج–م–ع; hamzah washl dan ta' tambahan: اِفْتَعَلَ.","time":25,"options":["اِفْتَعَلَ","اِسْتَفْعَلَ","تَفَاعَلَ","اِنْفَعَلَ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"ca6f9cd655709b3c11d8a23666fc50f8","cat":"mizan","type":"complete_rule","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa mizan sharfi (wazan) kata berikut?","ar":"مِفْتَاحٌ","explanation":"Huruf asli ف–ت–ح; mim di depan dan alif sebelum akhir: مِفْعَالٌ (salah satu wazan isim alat).","time":25,"options":["مِفْعَالٌ","مِفْعَلٌ","مِفْعَلَةٌ","مَفْعُولٌ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"a6ed57f6dc60bdad52f27bcea9128d8e","cat":"mizan","type":"complete_rule","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa mizan sharfi (wazan) kata berikut?","ar":"تَعَاوَنَ","explanation":"Huruf asli ع–و–ن; ta' di depan dan alif setelah fa' fi'il: تَفَاعَلَ.","time":30,"options":["تَفَاعَلَ","تَفَعَّلَ","فَاعَلَ","اِفْتَعَلَ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"9f1c0d6eb32f2b85b7af54cf7d6bc55e","cat":"mizan","type":"complete_rule","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa mizan sharfi (wazan) kata berikut?","ar":"أَصْحَابٌ","explanation":"Huruf asli ص–ح–ب; hamzah di depan dan alif sebelum akhir: أَفْعَالٌ (wazan jamak taksir).","time":30,"options":["أَفْعَالٌ","فِعَالٌ","فُعُولٌ","أَفْعِلَةٌ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"dc1e6beb2510f23f10db8772478d0a14","cat":"mujarrad-mazid","type":"complete_rule","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Fi'il berikut termasuk mujarrad atau mazid?","ar":"عَلَّمَ","explanation":"عَلَّمَ (فَعَّلَ): huruf asli ع–ل–م ditambah satu huruf (lam yang ditasydid).","time":20,"options":["Tsulatsi mazid satu huruf","Tsulatsi mujarrad","Tsulatsi mazid dua huruf","Ruba'i mujarrad"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"79a306a66e3635901432ea509b292707","cat":"mujarrad-mazid","type":"complete_rule","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Fi'il berikut termasuk mujarrad atau mazid?","ar":"اِسْتَعْمَلَ","explanation":"اِسْتَعْمَلَ (اِسْتَفْعَلَ): huruf asli ع–م–ل ditambah tiga huruf (hamzah washl, sin, ta').","time":25,"options":["Tsulatsi mazid tiga huruf","Tsulatsi mazid dua huruf","Ruba'i mazid","Tsulatsi mazid satu huruf"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"ba2948669792646408a7ff505ee0111d","cat":"mujarrad-mazid","type":"complete_rule","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Faedah (makna) wazan تَفَاعَلَ pada kata berikut adalah …","ar":"تَقَاتَلَ","explanation":"تَفَاعَلَ bermakna saling: تَقَاتَلَ = saling berperang.","time":25,"options":["Musyarakah (saling, dua pihak atau lebih)","Thalab (meminta)","Ta'diyah","Muthawa'ah"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"d3fcd1c9f298469ab8413f64394efcca","cat":"mujarrad-mazid","type":"complete_rule","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Faedah (makna) wazan اِنْفَعَلَ pada kata berikut adalah …","ar":"اِنْقَطَعَ","explanation":"اِنْفَعَلَ untuk muthawa'ah: قَطَعْتُهُ فَانْقَطَعَ (aku memutusnya, maka ia putus).","time":30,"options":["Muthawa'ah (menerima akibat perbuatan)","Thalab","Musyarakah","Ta'diyah"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"924d473aace7967b113af1b196a0e042","cat":"mujarrad-mazid","type":"complete_rule","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Faedah (makna) wazan فَعَّلَ pada kata berikut adalah …","ar":"فَرَّحَ","explanation":"فَرِحَ (gembira) intransitif; فَرَّحَ = menggembirakan (seseorang): ta'diyah.","time":30,"options":["Ta'diyah (menjadikan transitif)","Thalab","Musyarakah","Muthawa'ah"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"28a2e8ee34c603b4eea431b829c226a4","cat":"shahih-mutal","type":"complete_rule","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Fi'il berikut termasuk jenis apa?","ar":"نَصَرَ","explanation":"Semua huruf aslinya shahih, tanpa hamzah dan tanpa tasydid ganda: shahih salim.","time":20,"options":["Shahih salim","Mitsal","Ajwaf","Mahmuz"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"b4a1d0c72889016d6192760d756a14fc","cat":"shahih-mutal","type":"complete_rule","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Fi'il berikut termasuk jenis apa?","ar":"دَعَا","explanation":"Lam fi'il-nya huruf illat (asal wawu: دَعَوَ): naqish wawi.","time":25,"options":["Naqish","Ajwaf","Mitsal","Lafif"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"568e7a76a6a6a43c31a786ce3be14d77","cat":"shahih-mutal","type":"complete_rule","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Fi'il berikut termasuk jenis apa?","ar":"بَاعَ","explanation":"'Ain fi'il-nya huruf illat (asal ya': بَيَعَ): ajwaf ya'i.","time":25,"options":["Ajwaf","Naqish","Mitsal","Shahih salim"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"7284e7e5ddb04bdff738ad7902c6f2a0","cat":"shahih-mutal","type":"complete_rule","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Fi'il berikut termasuk jenis apa?","ar":"طَوَى","explanation":"طَوَى: 'ain (و) dan lam (ي) huruf illat yang berdampingan: lafif maqrun.","time":30,"options":["Lafif maqrun","Lafif mafruq","Ajwaf","Naqish"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"c5566ad65f629d5f63385f03e04d3f0f","cat":"shahih-mutal","type":"complete_rule","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Fi'il berikut termasuk jenis apa?","ar":"قَرَأَ","explanation":"Lam fi'il-nya hamzah: mahmuz al-lam, termasuk fi'il shahih.","time":30,"options":["Shahih mahmuz (mahmuz al-lam)","Naqish","Shahih salim","Mitsal"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"0c5ba975ac909b46a868c46cff7fb37c","cat":"madhi","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Ubah جَلَسَ untuk dhamir أَنْتُنَّ.","ar":null,"explanation":"أَنْتُنَّ → تُنَّ: جَلَسْتُنَّ.","time":25,"options":["جَلَسْتُنَّ","جَلَسْتُمْ","جَلَسْنَ","جَلَسْتُمَا"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"f43fdfc625c65d25471c374f432bef09","cat":"mudhari","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa fi'il mudhari' dari قَرَأَ untuk dhamir هِيَ?","ar":null,"explanation":"هِيَ → huruf mudhara'ah تَـ: تَقْرَأُ.","time":25,"options":["تَقْرَأُ","يَقْرَأُ","تَقْرَئِينَ","نَقْرَأُ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"b325e812e765c37da823a05c7299d9a8","cat":"amr","type":"tashrif_battle","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa fi'il amr dari تَذْهَبْنَ (untuk أَنْتُنَّ)?","ar":null,"explanation":"Amr untuk أَنْتُنَّ: buang huruf mudhara'ah, nun niswah tetap: اِذْهَبْنَ.","time":25,"options":["اِذْهَبْنَ","اِذْهَبُوا","اِذْهَبِي","اِذْهَبْ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"dd6769eff94fa887e45685f0976cdb0e","cat":"rafa","type":"irab_challenge","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"[[يَلْعَبُ]] الْأَطْفَالُ فِي الْحَدِيقَةِ","explanation":"Mudhari' tanpa amil nashab atau jazm: marfu' dengan dhammah.","time":20,"options":["Fi'il mudhari' marfu' dengan dhammah","Fi'il mudhari' manshub","Fi'il mudhari' majzum","Fi'il madhi mabni"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"22001ffa4692e52fccda6c6ef7697dc8","cat":"rafa","type":"irab_challenge","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"حَضَرَ [[الْمُدِيرُ]]","explanation":"الْمُدِيرُ fa'il, marfu' dengan dhammah (tanda asli).","time":20,"options":["Fa'il marfu' dengan dhammah","Mubtada' marfu'","Maf'ul bih manshub","Khabar marfu'"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"535297cdbc1ac214030086bf1d9db1c2","cat":"rafa","type":"irab_challenge","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"الْبِنْتَانِ [[تَكْتُبَانِ]]","explanation":"تَكْتُبَانِ termasuk al-af'al al-khamsah, marfu' dengan tetapnya nun. Jumlahnya khabar bagi الْبِنْتَانِ.","time":25,"options":["Fi'il mudhari' marfu' dengan tsubut an-nun","Fi'il mudhari' marfu' dengan dhammah","Fi'il mudhari' manshub","Isim marfu' dengan alif"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"aee7e3ea2ec2c49959dd891eb0364969","cat":"rafa","type":"irab_challenge","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"[[يَدْعُو]] الْمُسْلِمُ رَبَّهُ","explanation":"يَدْعُو mudhari' mu'tal akhir (wawu). Dhammah tidak tampak karena berat (tsiqal): dhammah muqaddarah.","time":25,"options":["Fi'il mudhari' marfu' dengan dhammah muqaddarah","Fi'il mudhari' marfu' dengan dhammah zhahirah","Fi'il mudhari' majzum","Fi'il madhi"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"128235e4ef9ae0d1f33351007a951d48","cat":"rafa","type":"irab_challenge","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"جَاءَ [[الْفَتَى]]","explanation":"الْفَتَى isim maqshur; harakat mustahil tampak pada alif (ta'adzur), sehingga dhammah muqaddarah.","time":30,"options":["Fa'il marfu' dengan dhammah muqaddarah karena ta'adzur","Fa'il marfu' dengan dhammah zhahirah","Fa'il marfu' dengan alif","Mubtada' marfu'"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"ee7f376ef75bfae7f7b5124e6a3be526","cat":"rafa","type":"nahwu_battle","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Pilih bentuk yang benar untuk melengkapi kalimat.","ar":"الطُّلَّابُ ـــــ الدَّرْسَ","explanation":"Tidak ada amil nashab/jazm, maka al-af'al al-khamsah marfu' dengan tsubut an-nun: يَفْهَمُونَ.","time":25,"options":["يَفْهَمُونَ","يَفْهَمُوا","يَفْهَمُ","يَفْهَمْنَ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"1493462d2d03c275b5eabc817c09f848","cat":"rafa","type":"complete_rule","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Isim mutsanna dan al-asma' al-khamsah ketika rafa' masing-masing ditandai dengan …","ar":null,"explanation":"Mutsanna rafa' dengan alif (الطَّالِبَانِ); asmaul khamsah rafa' dengan wawu (أَبُوكَ).","time":25,"options":["Alif dan wawu","Wawu dan alif","Dhammah dan wawu","Alif dan ya'"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"3a691ca68ed2c98c46be8e1c90e2fd0b","cat":"rafa","type":"grammar_detective","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Kalimat manakah yang SALAH? (Perhatikan tanda rafa' mutsanna.)","ar":null,"explanation":"Fa'il mutsanna marfu' dengan alif: جَاءَ الطَّالِبَانِ. Bentuk ya' untuk nashab dan jarr.","time":25,"options":["جَاءَ الطَّالِبَيْنِ","جَاءَ الطَّالِبَانِ","رَأَيْتُ الطَّالِبَيْنِ","سَلَّمْتُ عَلَى الطَّالِبَيْنِ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"9aecad00e48f35a232bafa5ace5f41ef","cat":"rafa","type":"sentence_analysis","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Manakah yang berkedudukan marfu' pada kalimat berikut?","ar":"إِنَّ الْأُسْتَاذَ يَشْرَحُ الدَّرْسَ","explanation":"الْأُسْتَاذَ isim inna (manshub), الدَّرْسَ maf'ul bih (manshub). يَشْرَحُ mudhari' marfu' dan jumlahnya khabar inna.","time":30,"options":["يَشْرَحُ (dan jumlahnya fi mahalli raf' sebagai khabar inna)","الْأُسْتَاذَ","الدَّرْسَ","Tidak ada"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"cf5092ea014a5f29324aaecfafe8bfae","cat":"rafa","type":"irab_challenge","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"حَضَرَ [[ذُو]] الْعِلْمِ","explanation":"ذُو (bermakna pemilik) termasuk asmaul khamsah, marfu' dengan wawu; ia fa'il dan mudhaf.","time":30,"options":["Fa'il marfu' dengan wawu karena asmaul khamsah","Fa'il marfu' dengan dhammah","Mubtada' marfu'","Mudhaf ilaih"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"ffaf2527d58868674885bf1d7df7560f","cat":"rafa","type":"irab_challenge","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"[[الْكِتَابُ]] مُفِيدٌ","explanation":"الْكِتَابُ mubtada' marfu' dengan dhammah.","time":20,"options":["Mubtada' marfu' dengan dhammah","Khabar marfu'","Fa'il marfu'","Maf'ul bih manshub"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"e9b08552b79087578e38d1443604c9ae","cat":"nashab","type":"irab_challenge","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"لَنْ [[أَتَأَخَّرَ]] غَدًا","explanation":"لَنْ huruf nashab (menafikan masa depan): أَتَأَخَّرَ manshub dengan fathah.","time":20,"options":["Fi'il mudhari' manshub dengan fathah karena لَنْ","Fi'il mudhari' marfu'","Fi'il mudhari' majzum","Fi'il madhi"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"10fcc29f3218aae4ae8e7550c2ef65dc","cat":"nashab","type":"irab_challenge","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"يُرِيدُ الطُّلَّابُ أَنْ [[يَنْجَحُوا]]","explanation":"أَنْ me-nashab-kan; al-af'al al-khamsah manshub dengan dibuangnya nun: يَنْجَحُوا.","time":25,"options":["Fi'il mudhari' manshub dengan hadzf an-nun","Fi'il mudhari' majzum dengan hadzf an-nun","Fi'il mudhari' marfu' dengan tsubut an-nun","Fi'il madhi"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"00b5da82965f64aab52e2730886ed9f5","cat":"nashab","type":"irab_challenge","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"لَنْ [[يَرْضَى]] الْمُعَلِّمُ بِالْكَسَلِ","explanation":"يَرْضَى mu'tal akhir alif; fathah tidak bisa tampak (ta'adzur): manshub dengan fathah muqaddarah.","time":25,"options":["Fi'il mudhari' manshub dengan fathah muqaddarah","Fi'il mudhari' manshub dengan fathah zhahirah","Fi'il mudhari' majzum dengan hadzf al-'illah","Fi'il mudhari' marfu'"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"c6d2de55ce19a685a2ded16bf4b08ecb","cat":"nashab","type":"irab_challenge","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"لَنْ [[يَدْعُوَ]] إِلَّا اللّٰهَ","explanation":"Mudhari' berakhir wawu/ya' saat manshub, fathahnya tampak karena ringan: لَنْ يَدْعُوَ.","time":30,"options":["Fi'il mudhari' manshub dengan fathah zhahirah","Fi'il mudhari' manshub dengan fathah muqaddarah","Fi'il mudhari' majzum","Fi'il mudhari' marfu'"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"eeaaf64645eef45c64809b0b5bb87448","cat":"nashab","type":"irab_challenge","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"صُمْتُ [[شَهْرًا]] كَامِلًا","explanation":"شَهْرًا menjelaskan lamanya waktu puasa: zharaf zaman (maf'ul fih), manshub.","time":30,"options":["Maf'ul fih (zharaf zaman) manshub","Maf'ul bih manshub","Tamyiz manshub","Hal manshub"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"5f1b947d9bccdf9ff4b31eb48c6b2dd6","cat":"nashab","type":"irab_challenge","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"ضَرَبْتُهُ [[ضَرْبًا]] شَدِيدًا","explanation":"ضَرْبًا mashdar dari fi'il yang sama untuk menjelaskan sifatnya: maf'ul muthlaq.","time":30,"options":["Maf'ul muthlaq manshub dengan fathah","Maf'ul bih manshub","Hal manshub","Tamyiz manshub"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"f0ee287298e2a4dcf75a1e0e02f90612","cat":"nashab","type":"irab_challenge","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"وَقَفَ الطُّلَّابُ [[احْتِرَامًا]] لِلْمُعَلِّمِ","explanation":"اِحْتِرَامًا menjelaskan sebab berdiri (karena hormat): maf'ul li ajlih/lahu, manshub.","time":30,"options":["Maf'ul li ajlih manshub dengan fathah","Maf'ul muthlaq","Hal manshub","Maf'ul bih"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"0fb0c4a6ee509454f4adde4c3d1f31a4","cat":"nashab","type":"nahwu_battle","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Pilih bentuk yang benar untuk melengkapi kalimat.","ar":"أُحِبُّ أَنْ ـــــ الْقُرْآنَ","explanation":"Setelah أَنْ mudhari' manshub: أَقْرَأَ.","time":20,"options":["أَقْرَأَ","أَقْرَأُ","أَقْرَأْ","قَرَأْتُ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"d173fd5653f40175aff20a5e7e1c3ad3","cat":"nashab","type":"nahwu_battle","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Pilih bentuk yang benar untuk melengkapi kalimat.","ar":"جِئْتِ لِـ ـــــ الْعَرَبِيَّةَ","explanation":"Lam ta'lil me-nashab-kan; untuk أَنْتِ, nun dibuang: لِتَتَعَلَّمِي.","time":25,"options":["تَتَعَلَّمِي","تَتَعَلَّمِينَ","تَتَعَلَّمْ","تَعَلَّمْتِ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"d28b8de75855f2d23642f8f823840a1e","cat":"nashab","type":"complete_rule","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Manakah kelompok huruf yang me-nashab-kan fi'il mudhari'?","ar":null,"explanation":"Nawashib mudhari': أَنْ، لَنْ، كَيْ، إِذَنْ. لَمْ/لَمَّا adalah jawazim, إِنَّ dkk. menashab isim, فِي dkk. huruf jar.","time":25,"options":["أَنْ، لَنْ، كَيْ، إِذَنْ","لَمْ، لَمَّا، لَا النَّاهِيَةُ","إِنَّ، أَنَّ، كَأَنَّ، لَيْتَ","فِي، مِنْ، إِلَى، عَلَى"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"ba0e128ac1a2d4956fc8c61a4def9043","cat":"nashab","type":"grammar_detective","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Kalimat manakah yang SALAH? (Perhatikan mudhari' setelah لَنْ.)","ar":null,"explanation":"Setelah لَنْ, al-af'al al-khamsah manshub dengan membuang nun: لَنْ يَذْهَبُوا.","time":30,"options":["لَنْ يَذْهَبُونَ إِلَى السُّوقِ","لَنْ يَذْهَبُوا إِلَى السُّوقِ","لَمْ يَذْهَبُوا إِلَى السُّوقِ","هُمْ يَذْهَبُونَ إِلَى السُّوقِ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"3316856fe3862016df21cd0a36845965","cat":"jarr","type":"irab_challenge","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"الْكِتَابُ عَلَى [[الْمَكْتَبِ]]","explanation":"عَلَى huruf jar → الْمَكْتَبِ majrur dengan kasrah.","time":20,"options":["Isim majrur dengan kasrah karena huruf jar","Mudhaf ilaih","Khabar marfu'","Na'at majrur"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"0fef6242414e543b6780b4411f025597","cat":"jarr","type":"irab_challenge","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"ذَهَبْتُ مَعَ [[أَخِيكَ]]","explanation":"مَعَ zharaf (bukan huruf jar), أَخِيكَ mudhaf ilaih, asmaul khamsah majrur dengan ya'.","time":25,"options":["Mudhaf ilaih majrur dengan ya' karena asmaul khamsah","Isim majrur oleh huruf jar","Maf'ul ma'ah manshub","Maf'ul bih"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"fc4b14cc8862aff37b502f72d5d522b8","cat":"jarr","type":"irab_challenge","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"نَظَرْتُ إِلَى [[الطَّائِرَتَيْنِ]]","explanation":"الطَّائِرَتَيْنِ mutsanna muannats, majrur oleh إِلَى dengan ya'.","time":25,"options":["Isim majrur dengan ya' karena mutsanna","Isim majrur dengan kasrah","Maf'ul bih manshub","Mudhaf ilaih"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"133c1f08c5b304ae8acaa6a369a2cf2e","cat":"jarr","type":"irab_challenge","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"دَرَسْتُ فِي [[مَدَارِسَ]] كَثِيرَةٍ","explanation":"مَدَارِسُ shighah muntahal jumu' tanpa ال dan tidak di-idhafah-kan, maka majrur dengan fathah.","time":30,"options":["Isim majrur dengan fathah karena mamnu' min ash-sharf","Isim majrur dengan kasrah","Maf'ul bih manshub","Tamyiz manshub"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"1266e56bbf70e8ae7086f20464fb838e","cat":"jarr","type":"irab_challenge","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"سَلَّمْتُ عَلَى [[مُصْطَفَى]]","explanation":"مُصْطَفَى isim maqshur: harakat tak dapat tampak pada alif (ta'adzur): kasrah muqaddarah.","time":30,"options":["Isim majrur dengan kasrah muqaddarah","Isim majrur dengan fathah","Isim majrur dengan kasrah zhahirah","Maf'ul bih"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"d2a76ad201ec977ea3a9463be0248381","cat":"jarr","type":"nahwu_battle","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Pilih bentuk yang benar untuk melengkapi kalimat.","ar":"خَرَجْتُ مِنَ ـــــ","explanation":"Isim setelah huruf jar majrur: مِنَ الْمَسْجِدِ.","time":20,"options":["الْمَسْجِدِ","الْمَسْجِدَ","الْمَسْجِدُ","مَسْجِدٌ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"0c4065ef06cbd72ef25e6b47a52278b4","cat":"jarr","type":"nahwu_battle","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Pilih bentuk yang benar untuk melengkapi kalimat.","ar":"تَحَدَّثْتُ مَعَ ـــــ","explanation":"مَعَ (zharaf) + mudhaf ilaih majrur; jamak mudzakkar salim majrur dengan ya': الْمُهَنْدِسِينَ.","time":25,"options":["الْمُهَنْدِسِينَ","الْمُهَنْدِسُونَ","الْمُهَنْدِسِينُ","مُهَنْدِسُونَ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"e72382e15e3baec82910d5f063cc8557","cat":"jarr","type":"complete_rule","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Isim yang majrur ada tiga sebab. Manakah yang BUKAN sebab jarr?","ar":null,"explanation":"Sebab jarr: huruf jar, idhafah, dan tabi'. Maf'ul bih justru manshub.","time":25,"options":["Menjadi maf'ul bih","Didahului huruf jar","Menjadi mudhaf ilaih","Mengikuti (tabi') kata yang majrur"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"b2e703a54d78faab4920b125e4795d0c","cat":"jarr","type":"grammar_detective","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Kalimat manakah yang SALAH? (Perhatikan jarr isim mamnu' min ash-sharf.)","ar":null,"explanation":"أَحْمَدُ mamnu' min ash-sharf (tanpa tanwin), di-jarr-kan dengan fathah: بِأَحْمَدَ.","time":25,"options":["مَرَرْتُ بِأَحْمَدٍ","مَرَرْتُ بِأَحْمَدَ","سَلَّمْتُ عَلَى زَيْدٍ","جَلَسْتُ مَعَ فَاطِمَةَ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"bbbd754f0d06ee33c3c598770ea4b3bf","cat":"jarr","type":"irab_challenge","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"رَجَعْتُ مِنَ [[السُّوقِ]]","explanation":"مِنْ huruf jar → السُّوقِ majrur dengan kasrah.","time":20,"options":["Isim majrur dengan kasrah karena huruf jar","Mudhaf ilaih","Maf'ul bih manshub","Na'at majrur"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"84a8a4b8a8b9781c49e1c5cde47bb6d6","cat":"jazm","type":"irab_challenge","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"لَمْ [[يَحْضُرْ]] أَحْمَدُ","explanation":"لَمْ men-jazm-kan: يَحْضُرْ majzum dengan sukun.","time":20,"options":["Fi'il mudhari' majzum dengan sukun","Fi'il mudhari' manshub","Fi'il mudhari' marfu'","Fi'il amr"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"d14cc7650fc2ad92edcae0da818087f8","cat":"jazm","type":"irab_challenge","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"لَا [[تَنْسَ]] وَاجِبَكَ","explanation":"لَا nahiyah men-jazm-kan; تَنْسَى mu'tal akhir, majzum dengan membuang alif: لَا تَنْسَ.","time":25,"options":["Fi'il mudhari' majzum dengan hadzf harf al-'illah","Fi'il mudhari' majzum dengan sukun","Fi'il amr","Fi'il mudhari' manshub"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"4492c1fdc08b5d913e1456b5a10bff41","cat":"jazm","type":"irab_challenge","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"لَمَّا [[يَصِلِ]] الْقِطَارُ","explanation":"لَمَّا huruf jazm (belum). يَصِلْ majzum dengan sukun, lalu dikasrah untuk menghindari dua sukun bertemu.","time":25,"options":["Fi'il mudhari' majzum dengan sukun, dikasrah karena bertemu sukun","Fi'il mudhari' majrur","Fi'il mudhari' manshub","Fi'il madhi"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"644febc0bde8dfecf604bfdaafbb849b","cat":"jazm","type":"irab_challenge","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"لِـ[[يَقُمْ]] كُلٌّ بِوَاجِبِهِ","explanation":"Lam amr men-jazm-kan: لِيَقُمْ (hendaklah ia melaksanakan). Wawu dibuang karena dua sukun bertemu.","time":30,"options":["Fi'il mudhari' majzum oleh lam amr","Fi'il mudhari' manshub oleh lam ta'lil","Fi'il amr mabni","Fi'il mudhari' marfu'"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"5b092d59dbd77dfbb7773139818090cd","cat":"jazm","type":"irab_challenge","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"مَنْ يَجْتَهِدْ [[يَنْجَحْ]]","explanation":"مَنْ syarthiyyah men-jazm-kan dua fi'il: يَجْتَهِدْ (fi'il syarat) dan يَنْجَحْ (jawab syarat).","time":30,"options":["Jawab syarat majzum dengan sukun","Fi'il syarat majzum","Fi'il mudhari' marfu'","Fi'il mudhari' manshub"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"b5a5945b01cc47a3932c84ba3252283e","cat":"jazm","type":"nahwu_battle","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Pilih bentuk yang benar untuk melengkapi kalimat.","ar":"لَمْ ـــــ الطَّالِبُ الدَّرْسَ","explanation":"لَمْ men-jazm-kan: يَكْتُبْ, dikasrah karena bertemu ال (dua sukun): لَمْ يَكْتُبِ الطَّالِبُ.","time":20,"options":["يَكْتُبِ","يَكْتُبُ","يَكْتُبَ","كَتَبَ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"820a733647df6b4d74e2fce5ee0f8f70","cat":"jazm","type":"nahwu_battle","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Pilih bentuk yang benar untuk melengkapi kalimat.","ar":"لَا ـــــ فِي الْفَصْلِ يَا طُلَّابُ","explanation":"لَا nahiyah + al-af'al al-khamsah → majzum dengan membuang nun: لَا تَتَكَلَّمُوا.","time":25,"options":["تَتَكَلَّمُوا","تَتَكَلَّمُونَ","تَتَكَلَّمْ","تَكَلَّمْتُمْ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"cf79b69173bdcb382b20fa4edb1f5c54","cat":"jazm","type":"nahwu_battle","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Pilih bentuk yang benar untuk melengkapi kalimat syarat.","ar":"إِنْ تَزْرَعْ ـــــ","explanation":"إِنْ syarthiyyah men-jazm-kan jawab syarat: تَحْصُدْ (jika kamu menanam, kamu memanen).","time":30,"options":["تَحْصُدْ","تَحْصُدُ","تَحْصُدَ","حَصَدْتُ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"836bd8c377018424ee5e4d72c2fce517","cat":"jazm","type":"complete_rule","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Fi'il mudhari' yang berakhir huruf illat ketika majzum ditandai dengan …","ar":null,"explanation":"Contoh: يَدْعُو → لَمْ يَدْعُ, يَرْمِي → لَمْ يَرْمِ, يَسْعَى → لَمْ يَسْعَ.","time":25,"options":["Dibuangnya huruf illat","Sukun","Dibuangnya nun","Fathah"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"6c3ca2588593f66508f037edd6e6f1f0","cat":"jazm","type":"grammar_detective","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Kalimat manakah yang SALAH? (Perhatikan mudhari' setelah لَمْ.)","ar":null,"explanation":"Setelah لَمْ, mudhari' mu'tal akhir majzum dengan membuang huruf illat: لَمْ يَرْمِ.","time":25,"options":["لَمْ يَرْمِي الْكُرَةَ","لَمْ يَرْمِ الْكُرَةَ","لَنْ يَرْمِيَ الْكُرَةَ","يَرْمِي الْكُرَةَ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"4acb1942713c34c0c1f664c1b4532b35","cat":"alamat-irab","type":"complete_rule","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa tanda i'rab asli untuk jarr?","ar":null,"explanation":"Tanda asli jarr adalah kasrah: مَرَرْتُ بِالطَّالِبِ.","time":20,"options":["Kasrah","Fathah","Dhammah","Sukun"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"6276c74ed2def9f3deaf45061542f45e","cat":"alamat-irab","type":"complete_rule","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa tanda i'rab asli untuk nashab?","ar":null,"explanation":"Tanda asli nashab adalah fathah: رَأَيْتُ الطَّالِبَ.","time":20,"options":["Fathah","Kasrah","Dhammah","Sukun"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"57bf20ed65f0b987faf8331855c60d87","cat":"alamat-irab","type":"complete_rule","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Apa tanda i'rab asli untuk jazm?","ar":null,"explanation":"Tanda asli jazm adalah sukun: لَمْ يَذْهَبْ.","time":20,"options":["Sukun","Fathah","Kasrah","Dhammah"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"597e18d1942a6fba8559d5d495d3de58","cat":"alamat-irab","type":"complete_rule","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Asmaul khamsah ketika manshub ditandai dengan …","ar":null,"explanation":"Asmaul khamsah: rafa' dengan wawu, nashab dengan alif, jarr dengan ya'. Contoh: رَأَيْتُ أَبَاكَ.","time":25,"options":["Alif","Wawu","Ya'","Fathah"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"bdc2ae908e3325d4c49fbf1bc3f1a090","cat":"alamat-irab","type":"complete_rule","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Jamak muannats salim ketika rafa' ditandai dengan …","ar":null,"explanation":"Jamak muannats salim rafa' dengan dhammah (tanda asli), nashab dan jarr dengan kasrah.","time":25,"options":["Dhammah","Wawu","Alif","Kasrah"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"28e08458656639781c3ba91c862d566b","cat":"alamat-irab","type":"complete_rule","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Isim mutsanna ketika manshub ditandai dengan …","ar":null,"explanation":"Mutsanna: rafa' dengan alif, nashab dan jarr dengan ya'. Contoh: رَأَيْتُ الطَّالِبَيْنِ.","time":25,"options":["Ya'","Alif","Kasrah","Wawu"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"fa5e94cf7a787bf7c4c6952e543a4ded","cat":"alamat-irab","type":"complete_rule","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Mengapa isim maqshur (seperti الْهُدَى) selalu di-i'rab dengan harakat muqaddarah?","ar":null,"explanation":"Alif tidak bisa menerima harakat (ta'adzur), sehingga semua harakat i'rab menjadi muqaddarah. Pada isim manqush alasannya tsiqal.","time":30,"options":["Karena ta'adzur (mustahil tampak pada alif)","Karena tsiqal (berat diucapkan)","Karena mabni","Karena mamnu' min ash-sharf"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"62355f603f5200f824d6547f990ba84f","cat":"alamat-irab","type":"complete_rule","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tanda nashab isim manqush (seperti الْقَاضِي) adalah …","ar":null,"explanation":"Isim manqush: dhammah dan kasrah muqaddarah (karena berat), tetapi fathah tampak karena ringan: رَأَيْتُ الْقَاضِيَ.","time":30,"options":["Fathah zhahirah","Fathah muqaddarah","Kasrah","Ya'"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"5651cc0055af86fd7b9ce6b2200af1ca","cat":"alamat-irab","type":"complete_rule","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Kata manakah yang i'rabnya dengan huruf (tanda far'i)?","ar":null,"explanation":"Jamak mudzakkar salim di-i'rab dengan huruf (wawu/ya'). Yang lain mufrad dengan harakat.","time":25,"options":["الْمُعَلِّمُونَ","الْمُعَلِّمُ","الْمُعَلِّمَةُ","مُعَلِّمٌ"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"7b433c7f4278bfa069048126dc13036a","cat":"alamat-irab","type":"complete_rule","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Isim mamnu' min ash-sharf kembali di-jarr-kan dengan kasrah apabila …","ar":null,"explanation":"Contoh: صَلَّيْتُ فِي الْمَسَاجِدِ / فِي مَسَاجِدِ الْقَاهِرَةِ (kasrah), tetapi فِي مَسَاجِدَ (fathah).","time":30,"options":["Diberi ال atau di-idhafah-kan","Menjadi fa'il","Didahului huruf nashab","Berbentuk mutsanna"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"893e1c459180fd98fa1de974b9c32c57","cat":"alamat-irab","type":"complete_rule","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Kata yang berubah akhirnya karena perbedaan 'amil disebut …","ar":null,"explanation":"Mu'rab = berubah akhirnya sesuai 'amil (contoh: الطَّالِبُ، الطَّالِبَ، الطَّالِبِ). Mabni = tetap.","time":20,"options":["Mu'rab","Mabni","Mamnu' min ash-sharf","Maqshur"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"469d7eacfd2ae71ef2fe939f16c37783","cat":"irab-jumlah","type":"irab_challenge","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"[[الْحَمْدُ]] لِلّٰهِ","explanation":"الْحَمْدُ mubtada' marfu'; لِلّٰهِ khabar (syibhu jumlah).","time":25,"options":["Mubtada' marfu' dengan dhammah","Fa'il marfu'","Khabar marfu'","Maf'ul bih manshub"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"c7dece2c603dcaf2530f013b113f66ca","cat":"irab-jumlah","type":"irab_challenge","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"الْجَنَّةُ تَحْتَ أَقْدَامِ [[الْأُمَّهَاتِ]]","explanation":"تَحْتَ zharaf (khabar), أَقْدَامِ mudhaf ilaih sekaligus mudhaf, dan الْأُمَّهَاتِ mudhaf ilaih majrur dengan kasrah.","time":25,"options":["Mudhaf ilaih majrur dengan kasrah","Isim majrur oleh huruf jar","Maf'ul bih manshub dengan kasrah","Na'at majrur"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"b82cf9fb5957093c43a2a07332c10b2c","cat":"irab-jumlah","type":"irab_challenge","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"[[بِسْمِ]] اللّٰهِ الرَّحْمَنِ الرَّحِيمِ","explanation":"بِـ huruf jar, اسْمِ majrur (dan mudhaf). Ia berkaitan dengan yang dibuang, misalnya أَبْدَأُ (aku memulai).","time":30,"options":["Jar-majrur yang berkaitan dengan fi'il atau khabar yang dibuang","Mubtada' marfu'","Maf'ul bih","Fa'il"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"57f257c634035f6f01932c20550ac817","cat":"irab-jumlah","type":"irab_challenge","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"الْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ رَبِّ [[الْعَالَمِينَ]]","explanation":"الْعَالَمِينَ mudhaf ilaih bagi رَبِّ, di-i'rab seperti jamak mudzakkar salim (mulhaq), majrur dengan ya'.","time":30,"options":["Mudhaf ilaih majrur dengan ya' (mulhaq jamak mudzakkar salim)","Isim majrur dengan kasrah","Na'at majrur","Maf'ul bih"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"5a82d8b6c089721904cdb62dffd718be","cat":"irab-jumlah","type":"irab_challenge","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"اِهْدِنَا [[الصِّرَاطَ]] الْمُسْتَقِيمَ","explanation":"اِهْدِ me-nashab-kan dua maf'ul: نَا (pertama, dhamir) dan الصِّرَاطَ (kedua). الْمُسْتَقِيمَ na'at-nya.","time":30,"options":["Maf'ul bih kedua manshub dengan fathah","Na'at manshub","Badal manshub","Maf'ul fih"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"116f40c36b2a729cbb2937291bb9ef62","cat":"irab-jumlah","type":"irab_challenge","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"إِنَّ اللّٰهَ مَعَ [[الصَّابِرِينَ]]","explanation":"مَعَ zharaf (khabar inna), الصَّابِرِينَ mudhaf ilaih majrur dengan ya'.","time":25,"options":["Mudhaf ilaih majrur dengan ya' karena jamak mudzakkar salim","Maf'ul bih manshub dengan ya'","Isim inna","Khabar inna"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"2c270f665c8e31768ad753677b271ea5","cat":"irab-jumlah","type":"irab_challenge","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"وَالْعَصْرِ إِنَّ [[الْإِنْسَانَ]] لَفِي خُسْرٍ","explanation":"الْإِنْسَانَ isim إِنَّ, manshub dengan fathah; لَفِي خُسْرٍ khabar inna (lam muzahlaqah + jar-majrur).","time":25,"options":["Isim inna manshub dengan fathah","Maf'ul bih manshub","Mubtada' marfu'","Khabar inna"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"9843eac13702591b17ab6f77dc585f6b","cat":"irab-jumlah","type":"irab_challenge","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"قَدْ أَفْلَحَ [[الْمُؤْمِنُونَ]]","explanation":"الْمُؤْمِنُونَ fa'il dari أَفْلَحَ, marfu' dengan wawu.","time":30,"options":["Fa'il marfu' dengan wawu karena jamak mudzakkar salim","Mubtada' marfu'","Maf'ul bih","Khabar marfu'"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"85ca2d5e0d8779c984fa79d087462379","cat":"irab-jumlah","type":"irab_challenge","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"إِيَّاكَ نَعْبُدُ وَإِيَّاكَ [[نَسْتَعِينُ]]","explanation":"نَسْتَعِينُ mudhari' marfu' (tidak ada amil nashab/jazm); fa'il dhamir mustatir takdirnya نَحْنُ.","time":30,"options":["Fi'il mudhari' marfu' dengan dhammah, fa'il-nya dhamir mustatir نَحْنُ","Fi'il mudhari' manshub","Fi'il mudhari' majzum","Isim marfu'"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"23e430eb2a99b08fb3e43763b4007b62","cat":"irab-jumlah","type":"sentence_analysis","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Kedudukan jumlah يَشْرَحُ الدَّرْسَ dalam kalimat berikut adalah …","ar":"رَأَيْتُ الْمُعَلِّمَ يَشْرَحُ الدَّرْسَ","explanation":"Jumlah setelah ma'rifah (الْمُعَلِّمَ) berkedudukan hal: aku melihat guru dalam keadaan menjelaskan pelajaran.","time":30,"options":["Hal fi mahalli nashb","Na'at fi mahalli nashb","Maf'ul bih kedua","Khabar fi mahalli raf'"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"a5a76b46766a7eac65840fa5abd54b74","cat":"irab-jumlah","type":"sentence_analysis","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Manakah maf'ul bih pada ayat berikut?","ar":"خَلَقَ اللّٰهُ السَّمَاوَاتِ","explanation":"السَّمَاوَاتِ maf'ul bih, jamak muannats salim manshub dengan kasrah. اللّٰهُ fa'il.","time":25,"options":["السَّمَاوَاتِ","اللّٰهُ","خَلَقَ","Tidak ada"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"6d6d5bb7cae4c94b6d9126d1c288fc08","cat":"jarr","type":"irab_challenge","level":"beginner","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"اِسْتَمَعْتُ إِلَى [[الْخُطْبَةِ]]","explanation":"إِلَى huruf jar → الْخُطْبَةِ majrur dengan kasrah.","time":20,"options":["Isim majrur dengan kasrah karena huruf jar","Mudhaf ilaih majrur","Maf'ul bih manshub","Na'at majrur"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"ac96e6ae23bbc9bce75bce8234d4e163","cat":"nashab","type":"irab_challenge","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"أُرِيدُ أَنْ [[أَشْتَرِيَ]] كِتَابًا","explanation":"أَشْتَرِي mu'tal akhir ya'. Saat manshub oleh أَنْ, fathah tampak karena ringan: أَنْ أَشْتَرِيَ.","time":25,"options":["Fi'il mudhari' manshub dengan fathah zhahirah","Fi'il mudhari' manshub dengan fathah muqaddarah","Fi'il mudhari' majzum","Fi'il mudhari' marfu'"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"7ddf37593ec42a6cc3faedb00824b2c3","cat":"rafa","type":"irab_challenge","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"[[الْمُمَرِّضَاتُ]] نَشِيطَاتٌ","explanation":"الْمُمَرِّضَاتُ mubtada', jamak muannats salim, marfu' dengan dhammah.","time":25,"options":["Mubtada' marfu' dengan dhammah (jamak muannats salim)","Khabar marfu'","Fa'il marfu'","Mubtada' marfu' dengan wawu"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"1e39ef6d6484f93422b3cd45c1f3a8d6","cat":"jazm","type":"irab_challenge","level":"advanced","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Tentukan kedudukan dan tanda i'rab kata yang ditandai.","ar":"لَمْ [[يَخْشَ]] إِلَّا اللّٰهَ","explanation":"يَخْشَى mu'tal akhir alif; setelah لَمْ majzum dengan membuang alif: لَمْ يَخْشَ.","time":30,"options":["Fi'il mudhari' majzum dengan hadzf harf al-'illah","Fi'il mudhari' majzum dengan sukun","Fi'il amr","Fi'il mudhari' manshub"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]},{"key":"cdd71981e8af73cc34cb9a6ea0f095f5","cat":"alamat-irab","type":"complete_rule","level":"intermediate","variety":"fusha","prompt":"Al-af'al al-khamsah ketika rafa' ditandai dengan …","ar":null,"explanation":"Al-af'al al-khamsah marfu' dengan tetapnya nun (يَكْتُبُونَ، تَكْتُبِينَ), manshub/majzum dengan dibuangnya nun.","time":25,"options":["Tetapnya nun","Dhammah","Wawu","Dibuangnya nun"],"correct":1,"accepted":[]}]$j$::jsonb) loop
    if not exists (select 1 from categories where slug = q->>'cat') then
      raise exception 'Kategori % tidak ada', q->>'cat';
    end if;
    v_q := null;
    insert into questions (seed_key, category_id, game_type, difficulty, variety, prompt, prompt_ar, explanation, time_limit_sec, is_published)
    select q->>'key', id, (q->>'type')::game_type, (q->>'level')::difficulty, (q->>'variety')::arabic_variety,
           q->>'prompt', q->>'ar', q->>'explanation', (q->>'time')::int, true
    from categories where slug = q->>'cat'
    on conflict (seed_key) do nothing
    returning id into v_q;
    continue when v_q is null;   -- sudah ada
    v_added := v_added + 1;

    for i in 0 .. jsonb_array_length(q->'options') - 1 loop
      insert into answer_options (question_id, label, is_arabic, position)
      values (v_q, q->'options'->>i, (q->'options'->>i) ~ '[\u0600-\u06FF]', i + 1);
    end loop;

    -- correct null = soal susun kalimat (dinilai lewat accepted_texts)
    v_correct := null;
    select id into v_correct from answer_options
    where question_id = v_q and position = (q->>'correct')::int;

    insert into answer_keys (question_id, correct_option_id, accepted_texts)
    values (v_q, v_correct, array(select jsonb_array_elements_text(q->'accepted')));
  end loop;
  raise notice 'Soal baru ditambahkan: %', v_added;
end
$seed$;
